(274, '4212201076', '1st place in Automation (PBL Expo Polibatam 2024)', 'Contest', '1st place', 'Awarded 1st place in the Automation System category using the PBL tool with the project titled Development of VR for Wiring Simulation on PLC Trainer Kit developed using Unity for application creation and SolidWorks for asset design.', '2024-08-08', 'Politeknik Negeri Batam', '3', 'Polikteknik Negeri Batam', 5, 'https://polibatam.id/pblexpo2024juara1sistemotomasi', 'https://polibatam.id/sertifexpojuara1otomasi', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
