(416, '4122201048', 'Vice Chief Executive — Business Management Leadership Camp 2022', '2022-01-01', NULL, 'Served as Vice Chief Executive for the “Manis Leci” (Manajemen Bisnis Leadership Camp) 2022, themed &quot;Build Character, Great Together,&quot; held at Politeknik Negeri Batam. Contributed to leadership training, team coordination, and event organization.', 'Politeknik Negeri Batam', 'https://bit.ly/Certificate-Puanliza', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
