(418, '4122201048', 'Certificate of Competency in Word, Data Processing, and Presentation Preparation for Administrative Staff', '2021-01-01', NULL, 'Successfully completed the competency program “Mengolah Kata, Data dan Membuat Presentasi bagi Tenaga Administrasi,” verified by Kartu Prakerja. Covered skills in word processing, data handling, and creating professional presentations, with a post-test score of 80 and a learning duration of 11 hours 10 minutes.', 'Karier.mu by Sekolah.mu', 'https://bit.ly/Certificate-Puanliza', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
