(513, '3112311072', 'Internship at Class I Port Health Office in Batam', '2022-01-01', NULL, 'I did an internship in the Administration Department. During my internship, I often recorded incoming and outgoing mail, selected archives according to period, and entered archive documents into Microsoft Excel. With my experience, I learned about the importance of accuracy in organizing archives, managing documents, and being disciplined in carrying out assigned tasks.', 'Class I Port Health Office in Batam', 'https://polibatam.id/SertifikatMagangSukma_3112311072', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
