(607, '3412431002', 'MAGNETIC PARTICLE TESTING', '2023-01-01', NULL, 'Equipment Setup &amp; Calibration: Adept at calibrating and maintaining NDT equipment.\r\nInterpretation &amp; Evaluation: Interprets test results against codes, standards, and specifications.\r\nReporting: Documents inspection results and prepares detailed reports.\r\nGuidance: Provides on-the-job training and guidance to Level 1 technicians and assistants.', 'IKBAL-M-YOS', 'https://polibatam.id/BoyFabloSilalahi', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
