(633, '4322301045', 'International PBL Expo', '2025-01-01', NULL, 'have the opportunity to participate in the PBL Expo exhibition held by the Batam State Polytechnic in semester 4 of 2025', 'Politeknik Negeri Batam', 'https://polibatam.id/CertivicatePBLExpo', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(634, '4322301045', 'Certificate of Completion - PBL Semester 3', '2024-01-01', NULL, 'In PBL Semester 3, I was responsible for creating 2D character animations using OpenToonz. In addition to the animation process, I also worked on editing the animations into trailers and developing concepts and story ideas to strengthen the projects flow and visuals.', 'Politeknik Negeri Batam', 'https://polibatam.id/CertificatePBLSemester3', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(635, '4322301045', 'Certificate of Completion - PBL Semester 4', '2025-01-01', NULL, 'In PBL Semester 4, I was responsible for compiling a PBL process report and creating a rig for the characters legs to ensure proper animation. In this project, I learned the character rigging process to support more flexible and efficient animation movements, while also improving my technical skills, project documentation, and teamwork throughout the production process.', 'Politeknik Negeri Batam', 'https://polibatam.id/CertificatePBLSemester4', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(636, '4322301045', 'Certificate of Completion  PBL Semester 5', '2026-01-01', NULL, 'In PBL Semester 5, I was responsible for creating environmental assets and properties for Nagoya Hill Mall and Elyora Beach for a game aimed at showcasing iconic buildings and places in Batam. In addition to modeling, I also worked on texturing and lighting to create a more realistic and engaging visual environment, tailored to the projects needs.', 'Politeknik Negeri Batam', 'https://polibatam.id/CertificatePBLSemester5', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
