(391, '3112301005', 'An active Diploma 3 Accounting student at Politeknik Negeri Batam with a strong interest in\r\nfinancial reporting and taxation. Skilled in bookkeeping, preparing financial statements, and\r\nunderstanding Indonesian tax regulations. Proficient in Microsoft Excel, Word, and accounting\r\nsoftware such as ABSS (MYOB). Highly motivated, detail-oriented, and able to work both\r\nindependently and as part of a team.', '3.75', 'nyayunajwa06@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Griya Permata Batu Aji Blok D No. 54, Kepulauan Riau', '87761184126', 'Bookkeeping, financial reports,Microsoft Excel', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(392, '3112301006', 'I am an active student at Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Accounting with a GPA of 3.55. I have experience in administration and financial management in campus organizations. I have skills in transaction verification, transaction data recording, and financial report preparation. Currently, I am eager to develop my skills in a professional setting.', '3,55', 'nrlacc569@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Asrama Politeknik Negeri Batam', '85664053477', 'Microsoft Office  Spreadsheets,use ABSS Accounting System', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(393, '3112301007', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(394, '3112301008', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(395, '3112301009', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(396, '3112301010', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(397, '3112301012', 'Mahasiswa akuntansi dengan latar belakang analisis keuangan, pelaporan, dan audit. Memiliki keahlian dasar dalam analisis laporan keuangan, dan penggunaan software akuntansi. Berkomitmen untuk terus mengembangkan keterampilan praktis dan siap berkontribusi aktif dalam tim profesional.', '0', 'sopiatii020@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Benkong Kolam Gang Akasia Blok 12 C No 12', '82285719135', 'Basic Accounting and Financial,Teamwork and Collaboration, and Communication Skills', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(398, '3112301013', 'D3 Accounting Study Program students have a great foundation in financial management, financial statement analysis, and budget management, using Microsoft Exel, SAP and ABSS. Active in accounting-related academic projects as well as campus organizations that hone analytical and communication skills.', '3.73', 'clarasiburian595@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tiban Harapan Inda, Sekupang, Batam', '85123035682', 'Analytical Thinking, Attention to Detail, Problem-Solving', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
