(406, '3112301026', 'I am an active student of Accounting Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic who\r\nhas great interest in finance and taxation. Have the ability to prepare financial and\r\ntaxation reports in accordance with the accounting cycle. Skilled in operating various\r\nsoftware such as Microsoft Office, ABSS, and SAP. In addition to technical abilities,\r\nI also have good communication, teamwork, and problem-solving skills. Ready to\r\nlearn and contribute professionally in a dynamic work environment.', '4', 'afrilyana9405@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Wahyu Gang Sakura No.12. Kelurahan Tanjung Buntung Kecamatan Bengkong', '87886988633', 'Leadership and team management,Use of ABSS accounting softwar,Basics of using SAP', 0, '-', 'afrily_ana', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
