(408, '3112301031', 'I am an active 4th semester student of D3 Accounting Program of Batam State Polytechnic class of 2023. Have good communication skills and skilled in bookkeeping and preparation of financial reports. Currently focusing on developing abilities and applying Accounting knowledge in a professional work environment.', '3,23', 'zefanyasiregar5@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Anugrah Residence Blok B6 No.09', '81365894628', 'Microsoft Word,Analysis', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(409, '3112301032', 'Active student of D3 Accounting Study Program at Politeknik Negeri Batam, has a strong interest in taxation, financial accounting and taxation. Experienced in developing accounting modules for various types of service, trading, and manufacturing companies and active as a tax volunteer at the Directorate General of Taxes. My skills include accounting data processing, tax reporting and software usage. I also have experience in committee work and public speaking as an MC. High learning spirit, communicative, and able to work together in a team or independently.', '3,78', 'nyayunajla440@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Jl. Biru Safir 2', '87842894780', 'Microsoft Office,Google Workspace,Softskill', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(410, '3112301033', 'Student at Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Management and Business, Accounting study program. Experienced as a Master of Ceremony. Active in organizations and has a keen interest in communication, social issues, and the environment.', '0', 'nuraisyahjumala01@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tembesi Lestari No 20 RT 04 RW 013', '87878448980', 'Languages: Indonesian (Fluent), English (Beginner) Skills: Public Speaking, Teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(411, '3112301034', 'An active student of the Diploma 3 Accounting Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic with a background in pharmacy and internship experience in the health sector. Has a strong interest in finance and accounting, and actively participates in various campus projects and organizations, particularly in the development of accounting and capital market modules. Skilled in Microsoft Excel and Word, and has a basic understanding of accounting software such as MYOB/ABSS and SAP. Has good communication skills through experience in Public Relations. Ready to contribute in a professional work environment, especially in the field of finance.', '0', 'tiara2004ara@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, kecamatan lubuk baja tg. uma kp agas rt 03 rw 03 no 20', '8116912504', 'The skills I have are as follows: Microsoft Excel &amp; Word  Public Relations MYOB/ABSS  SAP Fundamentals', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
(412, '3112301035', '4th semester Accounting student with experience in accounting and organizational experience in administration and financial management. Has the ability in bookkeeping, preparation of financial statements, auditing, analysis of financial statements, understanding of taxation, calculation and management of cash, and recording transaction data. Currently has a desire to develop auditing and financial data analysis skills in a professional scope.', '3.80', 'oliviazaliantys18@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sagulung Sumber Sari Blok D12 No.45', '82117062557', 'Microsoft Office,Communication,Time Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:30', '2026-07-06 20:58:30'),
