(963, '3222301015', 'Electronics Manufacturing Engineering student with experience in PCB assembly, product testing, and the use of electronic measuring instruments. Possesses high accuracy, problem-solving skills, and a motivation to contribute to quality improvement and manufacturing processes through internships. Committed to continuous learning, skill development, and a willingness to work professionally to support the company  goals.', '3.49', 'ciciherlina677@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong harapan 2 blok j no 64 Rt 03 rw 04 kelurahan bengkong laut .kec Bengkong  batam', '81949032422', 'PCB Assembly,Electronic Measurement Tools,Microsoft Office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
(964, '3222301016', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
(965, '3222301017', 'A 5th-semester Electronics Manufacturing student at Batam State Polytechnic with 8 months of \r\nindustrial internship experience as an Assistant Production Engineer. Skilled in PCB manufacturing, \r\nSMT, IC Packaging, PCBA rework/repair, and visual inspection. Strong adaptability, leadership, and \r\npublic speaking skills. Eager to contribute and gain further experience through an internship in \r\nmanufacturing and quality engineering.', '3.53', 'juandaandriano.s@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav Kamboja Blok LL No.09', '82173146946', 'PCB Manufacturing ,Surface Mount Technology,IC Packing', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
