(974, '3222301033', 'an Electrical Engineering student at Polibatam that focus on manufacturing electronics industry, hands-on experience in electronics assembly using SMT or THT, Semiconductor Packaging (FOL, EOL). Inspection tools &amp; measurement tools, specifically for using in ISO-7 Cleanroom area.', '3.49', 'jefryadityasgn@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Batu Aji Indah 2 Blok O No 03', '6282389582707', 'Semiconductor Packaging,Surface Mount Technology', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
(975, '3222301034', 'Electronics Manufacturing Engineering student with basic understanding in learning IC Packaging process, SMT (Surface Mount Technology), PCBA Repair and Rework. Skilled in inspecting soldering results referring to IPC standards. Have an interest in electronics manufacturing processes, able to work in teams, and have high motivation to develop themselves through the internship program.', '0', 'milanurazzahraz@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida Ayu Blok J no 22 RT03/RW08', '89523775585', 'Soldering (SMD and PTH) PCBA Repair and Rework,Troubleshooting Elektronik,Microsoft Word', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
