(990, '3222311001', 'Active student of the Diploma in Electronics Manufacturing Engineering with a strong interest in electronics, quality assurance, and microcontroller module assembly and testing. Experienced in electronic manufacturing processes, including solder paste printing, pick &amp;amp; place, reflow soldering, and quality inspection using AOI, 3D Keyence, and X-Ray. Skilled in electronic circuit design, RF simulation, and familiar with PCB design software. Possesses strong teamwork, attention to detail, and high motivation to continuously learn and contribute to the electronics manufacturing and quality control industry.', '3.44/4.00', 'marettata04@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tj. TEritip RT 03/10 No. 49, Tj. Uma, Lubuk Baja, Kota Batam', '88271670398', 'Electronic manufacturing proce,Measurement &amp; Testing ,Quality inspection', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
(991, '3222311002', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
(992, '3222311004', 'Saya adalah seorang individu yang aktif mengembangkan diri di bidang akademik dan teknis, dengan pengalaman dalam proyek penelitian serta implementasi teknologi, seperti sistem mikrokontroler dan integrasi perangkat elektronik. Selain fokus pada pengembangan ilmu, saya juga memiliki jiwa kreatif dan kepemimpinan, tercermin dari keterlibatan dalam tim, presentasi akademik, serta inisiatif membuat karya inovatif yang berorientasi pada paten dan perbaikan proses industri.', '3.46', 'Srparadepurba@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Eden Park Blok H No 12, Batam Centre', '82294378243', 'kepemimpinan, komunikasi, teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
(993, '3222311008', 'I&#039;m a student of Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Manufacturing of Electronics Engineering. I have expertise in PCBA \r\nRework and Repair, SMT (Surface Mount Technology) Process, IC (Integrated Circuit) Packaging, and Industrial Metrology . With my knowledge and skills, I strive to continue developing myself in these areas to make a positive contribution to the \r\ntechnology industry.', '0', 'srmlamengla22@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Aku Tahu 2 Blok E No. 29, Sungai Panas', '81389084383', 'Team Leadership, Problem Solving,teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:31', '2026-07-06 20:58:31'),
