(1344, '3232301025', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1345, '3232301026', 'I am a student at Batam State Polytechnic with a focus on Electrical Engineering, specifically in the Instrumentation Study Program. I have a strong interest in measurement systems, calibration, and process control. I am accustomed to working with various laboratory equipment and understand the basic principles of accuracy and data traceability. During my studies, I actively developed analytical skills, problem-solving, and precision in every practicum and project undertaken.', '0', 'brianaviando@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Cipta Asri Blok.F, No.77, Tembesi, Batam.', '83867472465', 'active english,leadership,dicipline', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1346, '3232301030', 'I am an active student majoring in Electrical Engineering Instrumentation at the State Polytechnic of Batam, with strong interest in energy systems, instrumentation, and industrial automation. I am eager to apply my technical skills in real industrial settings such as energy distribution and oil &amp;amp; gas operations', '3,36', 'rajabilivalhaq@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam Sei Beduk Pancur Biru Lestari 2 Block K no 6', '83195554750', 'Electrical  Instrumentation,Electrical Design,Electrical Maintenance', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1347, '3232301032', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1348, '3232301034', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1349, '3232301037', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1350, '3232301038', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1351, '3232301044', 'Mahasiswa aktif semester 5 Jurusan Teknik Elektro – Program Studi Teknik Instrumentasi di Politeknik Negeri Batam. Berpengalaman dalam Project Based Learning (PBL) dan Program Kreativitas Mahasiswa (PKM). Terampil dalam analisis serta pengolahan data sistem SCADA, akuisisi dan kalibrasi instrumen, serta memiliki dasar teknis kuat di bidang instrumentasi dan otomasi. Memiliki kemampuan analisis dan pemecahan masalah yang baik dengan pendekatan berbasis data.', '0', 'definaedel9@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Jl. Ahmad Yani, Tlk. Tering, Kec. Batam Kota, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau 29461', '87790517761', 'Possesses strong technical and analytical abilities, including data analysis, instrument calibration', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1352, '3232301051', 'Saya merupakan mahasiswa aktif Politeknik Negeri Batam, Jurusan Teknik Elektro, Program Studi D3 Teknik Instrumentasi. Saya memiliki ketertarikan di bidang otomasi industri dan pengembangan teknologi. Selama masa studi, saya telah memperoleh pengalaman dalam pemrograman menggunakan Arduino IDE serta perakitan perangkat elektronik untuk berbagai proyek. Saya terbiasa bekerja secara kolaboratif dalam tim, memiliki kemampuan komunikasi yang baik, dan selalu termotivasi untuk terus belajar serta mengembangkan keterampilan baru yang relevan dengan kebutuhan dunia kerja.', '3.22', 'halimhidayat2004@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Graha Mas Blok A3 NO. 3', '85363894538', 'Experienced in assembling panel box components according to production standard,Developed a portable water qua,Developed a smart fish feeding', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1353, '3232301061', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1354, '3232301065', 'Instrumentation Engineering major. Strong interest in control systems, automation, sensors, and data\r\nacquisition. Experienced in academic and practical projects involving microcontroller programming,\r\nOmron CP1H PLC, SCADA, and instrumentation system integration. Accustomed to working in a\r\nteam, problem-solving oriented, and motivated to continuously learn and develop in the field of\r\nindustrial technology.', '3.20', 'riarahmanda@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Baloi Indah Anggrek Blok B No.2', '82169654502', 'Instrumentation &amp; Control', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1355, '3232311001', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1356, '3232311002', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1357, '3232311006', 'WELDERQUALIFICATION TES\r\nRECORD 3G SMAW AND 6G GTAW', '2.42', 'mhmrhnn@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum,puskopkar Blok A7 NO.14 Batu Aji- Batam', '81276787128', 'WELDERQUALIFICATION TES RECORD', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1358, '3232311008', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1359, '3232311009', 'Mahasiswa Teknik Elektro Instrumentasi Politeknik Negeri Batam dengan keahlian dalam Microsoft Office, sistem kelistrikan,SCADA, PLC, dan pneumatik. Memiliki pengalaman kerja di industri sebagai Incoming Quality Control di PT Surya Teknologi Batam selama 2 tahun serta operator mesin cutting di PT Shimano Batam. Aktif dalam proyek otomasi seperti akuisisi data dan kalibrasi sensor pH serta pengembangan Human Machine Interface (HMI) berbasis komunikasi Ethernet. Meraih Juara 2 pada ajang PBL Expo International kategori Automation yang diselenggarakan oleh Politeknik Negeri Batam. Memiliki motivasi tinggi untuk berkontribusi dalam pengembangan sistem otomasi berbasis Industry 4.0.', '3.31', 'herrykristiadi19@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Bumi Sarana Indah 2 Blok E No. 22, Kec. Batu Aji, Kel. Buliang, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '82387004071', '•	Programmable Logic Control Software ,•	AutoCAD Electrical ,•	Pneumatic', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1360, '3232311010', 'CompanyI graduated from Vocational High School 1 Batam, specializing in Industrial Electronics Engineering in2022. Currently, I am pursuing a degree in Instrumentation Engineering at the State Polytechnic of Batam(Night Class). I am quick to adapt to new environments, capable of working both independently and as partof a team, and have a strong passion for learning and growing in the field of technology. I am eager toexplore new opportunities in Electrical Engineering, Technician roles, and other related areas where I canapply my skills and contribute to innovative projects.', '3.55', 'larryyudiane@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Galaxy Park Blok E3 No 4', '89512651087', 'Learn &amp; Apply Electrical, Instrumentation, Automation', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1361, '3232311014', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1362, '3232311021', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1363, '3232311022', 'Experienced electrical and technical professional with hands-on expertise in handling customer electrical disturbances (SR &amp; APP), maintaining distribution networks (JTR &amp; JTM), and conducting substation inspections. Skilled in diagnosing technical faults and performing repairs in accordance with SOP and strict K3 safety standards. Proficient in operating precision measuring instruments and machining equipment, including CNC, milling, grinding, and fabrication tools. Committed to delivering reliable performance, technical accuracy, and operational efficiency in field and workshop environments.', '2.48', 'alfa.siregar17@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Asrama Blok A3 No.9', '82277662835', 'Electrical Distribution,CNC &amp; Fabrication', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
(1364, '3232311023', '-', '3.39', 'anthonio.zhivago139@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Griya asri', '81996548189', 'c#,labview,data acquisition', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
