(1367, '3232311043', 'I am an Instrumentation Engineering student at Politeknik Negeri Batam with a strong interest in automation systems, programming, and data integration. I enjoy developing applications using Visual Studio and working on projects that combine software with hardware such as PLCs and sensors.\r\nCurrently, I am gaining hands-on industrial experience at PT Rubycon Indonesia, particularly in the Slitting Department, where I am involved in the production process and machine operation. This experience has strengthened my understanding of industrial workflow, instrumentation application, and equipment maintenance. I am a fast learner, detail-oriented, responsible, and able to work both independently and collaboratively in a team environment.', '3.27', 'dolyfransisco2004@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'KAVLING BARU BIDA KABIL BLOK F NO. 82', '81937056281', 'Visual Studio(C#) and PLC ,Instrumentation and Sensors ,Microsoft Excel and Word', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:32', '2026-07-06 20:58:32'),
