(2024, '3312301010', 'Currently a fifth semester Informatics Engineering student at Batam State Polytechnic, with a\r\nkeen interest in software development and technology. Often responsible for the front-end aspect\r\nof team projects. I am motivated to learn, improve, and contribute to impactful project.', '-', 'Alia.3312301010@students.polibatam.ac.id', 'default.jpg', 'Batam State Polytechnic', '628', 'UI/UX Design ,Software Development,Problem Solving', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
(2025, '3312301011', 'Active students in Semester 4 of the D3 Informatics Engineering Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic, class of 2023. Have good communication skills and adapt quickly new environment. During college, I have participated in several project-based learning which focuses on creating web applications and IoT, especially in the UI/UX design aspect. Besides that, have the ability to prepare project documentation and reports, ensuring each the output files are arranged neatly and according to standards.', '3.78 / 4.00', 'elvirafitriayu@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumnas Griya Permata Block A Number 383', '89516392390', 'UI/UX Design ,Website Development,IoT Systems Development', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
(2026, '3312301012', 'An active D3 student majoring in Computer Engineering at Batam State Polytechnic with hands-on experience in web and mobile development, as well as UI/UX design using Figma. Driven by a passion for collaboration and innovation, I excel in contributing to current digital projects. Proficient in managing tasks from initial design concepts to front-end implementation, I maintain a strong focus on user-oriented design principles to create engaging and effective user experiences.', '3.50', 'dilazahara55@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong', '83174218348', 'microsoft word,canva,figma', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
(2027, '3312301013', 'I am a 4th semester Informatics Engineering student at the State Polytechnic of Batam with hands-on experience in both web and mobile application development projects. I have basic technical skills in UI/UX design and front-end development, particularly in the early-stage analysis and planning of applications. With proven communication and problem-solving skills, I am highly motivated to learn and contribute to impactful projects in the field of Informatics.', '3.91', 'velasyifa02@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '895609413980', 'UI/UX Design,Frontend Developer,Mobile Developer', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
