(2039, '3312301030', 'I am an Informatics Engineering student at Politeknik Negeri Batam with experience in web programming and a growing passion for mobile development. My primary focus is on frontend development, where I combine my technical skills with a strong understanding of UI/UX design to create intuitive and user-friendly applications. Additionally, I have experience in database management, ensuring efficient data handling to support seamless application performance. I am always eager to learn new technologies and collaborate on innovative projects that enhance user experiences.', '3.89', 'firmansyah.3312301030@students.polibatam.ac.id', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Permai Blok F No. 46', '81364687273', 'Web Programming,Mobile Programming,UI/UX Design', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
