(2059, '3312301060', 'I am a D3 Information Technology student who is eager to develop my skills in the field of information technology through internship experience. I have basic knowledge in programming, database management, and system administration. I am familiar with the latest technology tools, a quick learner, and ready to contribute in both individual and team work environments.', '3.30', 'farrelardanto135@gmal.com', 'default.jpg', 'TAMAN SARI HIJAU BLK D6 NO 09', '6282174657245', 'UI/UX Designer,Junior Fullstack Web Dev,MySQL Database', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
(2060, '3312301061', 'Fourth-semester Computer Science student with experience in developing web-based applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Laravel, as well as simple mobile applications using Flutter. Has worked on several small projects to learn the basics of UI/UX and system integration. Also has experience in developing websites for IoT systems. Continuously improving technical skills through real-world projects, self-directed learning and hands-on practice.', '3.70', 'maharanisindy01@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sungai Panas, Batam, Kepulauan R', '8116950674', 'Language and Framework : JavaS,Tools: Visual Studio Code, Git', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
(2061, '3312301062', 'Dedicated Informatics Engineering student from Politeknik Negeri Batam with a passion for technology and a desire to gain practical experience at Intern. I am adept at using Microsoft Office and skilled in programming with Laravel, PHP, Python, and MySQL. My commitment to effective communication and collaborative teamwork will allow me to seamlessly integrate and make meaningful contributions to your projects', '3.92', 'teddy.3312301062@students.polibatam.ac.id', 'default.jpg', 'Permata Baloi Blok E6 No 20', '82230567296', 'PHP,Python,Visual Studio Code', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
