(2142, '3312311091', 'I am an experienced CNC Programmer skilled in design, programing, and machine trial. Proficient in CAD/CAM, develop precise machining programs to enhance eficiency and production quality. With expertise in troubleshooting and process optimalization, I am commites to delivering high-quality components with maxximun efficiency. Also skilled in full stack web development, capable of building and maintaining web applications effectively.', '0', 'riskiwahyudi1306@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Taman lestari, blok B4 no 18 , kel. Kibing, kec. Batu aji , Batam, kepulauan Riau.', '81277561383', 'CNC Milling Programming,Mechanical Designer  ,Full Stack Web Developer', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
(2143, '3312311092', 'Enthusiastic developer with hands-on experience in building web, mobile, and game applications.\r\nProficient in delivering clean, scalable, and user-centric solutions across platforms. Actively explores new\r\ntechnologies and best practices while continuously improving technical skills and spoken English for\r\nbetter global collaboration.', '3.93', 'offelmarbun@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Indonesia, Kepulauan Riau, Batam, Centra Melati Blok C1 No 1', '85274637588', 'Mobile Developer,Fullstack Programmer,UI/UX Designer', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:33', '2026-07-06 20:58:33'),
