(2473, '3322301028', 'Active student in the 5th semester of the D3 Geomatics Technology program at Batam State Polytechnic. Possesses strong public speaking and problem-solving skills, and is proficient in using software such as ArcGIS, QGIS, and AutoCAD. Has a solid foundation in GNSS surveying, photogrammetry, GIS, and topographic mapping.  Demonstrates a high level of enthusiasm for learning, active involvement in organizational activities, and the ability work collaboratively in a team, and adapt easily to new environments.', '3.70', 'elsyahati@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Cipta Asri', '81374287996', 'autocad,ArcGis,Qgis', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:34', '2026-07-06 20:58:34'),
