(2986, '3412301042', 'Greetings, I&#039;m currently a final year in the Mechanical Engineering department at Politeknik Negeri Batam, I&#039;m very interested at 3d design, 2d design with some software like SolidWorks, AutoCAD, Master Cam, Inventor. I have study of mechanical machine like manual turning, manual miling, surface grinding, band saw and CNC Miling. Overall, I&#039;m very curios about manufacture world and i like study more about it, almost 3 years now i study mechanical engineering and still going on.', '3.7', 'irhakashtowi@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Simpang kara, batam center', '81273505430', 'SolidWorks,AutoCAD,MasterCAM', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:35', '2026-07-06 20:58:35'),
