(3008, '3412301084', 'I am a D3 Mechanical Engineering student at Batam State Polytechnic with internship experience as a Process Quality Engineer in an electronics industry company while still in vocational school. In that role, I was involved in the production process, quality analysis, and ensuring product quality standards in accordance with the specified specifications. I have expertise in reading engineering drawings, as well as competence in operating lathes and milling machines. In addition, I can use design and manufacturing software such as CAD, SolidWorks, and SolidCAM. I also have basic skills in CNC (Computer Numerical Control) programming and am able to operate various measuring instruments such as Micro Vu, micrometers, and calipers and I also studied basic welding science, namely NDT (MT, PT and Visual Test)', '3.91', 'adventsimanjuntak7@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tembesi Lestari', '81363875950', 'SolidWorks, SolidCAM  CNC Programming (CNC Lathe &amp; Milling)  CAD Design Manufaktur  Micro Vu, Mikrometer', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:35', '2026-07-06 20:58:35'),
(3009, '3412301085', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:35', '2026-07-06 20:58:35'),
(3010, '3412301088', 'Mechanical Engineering student at Politeknik Negeri Batam (since 2023), with skills in design, production, and maintenance. Able to operate Microsoft Office. Hardworking, adaptable, and able to work well both independently and in teams. Confident in public speaking and always open to learning new thing.', '3.76', 'sitepusherly3@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav.Bukit Seroja blok I/106', '81909738679', 'Operate Conventional Machine , CAD and Solidworks (include CAM), Microsoft Office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:35', '2026-07-06 20:58:35'),
