(3690, '4112201065', 'Cicilya Hutapea is an active student at Batam State Polytechnic majoring in Business Management, Managerial Accounting Study Program. Active in organizations, has Public Speaking skills as proven by several times being a host and moderator in various organizational activities. I have adaptive and responsible abilities, time discipline and enthusiasm for learning new things, I can work together with a team and complete tasks on time. I aim to pursue a career in Accounting and Human Resources.', '3.69', 'cicilyadebora4@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling Bukit Indah Blok A3 no.12 RT 02, RW 20', '83196585011', 'Hard Skills (Technical) Prepar,Organizational &amp; Event Plannin,Soft Skills Effective Communic', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:36', '2026-07-06 20:58:36'),
