(3706, '4112201081', '-Managerial Accounting  Student Politeknik Negeri Batam has experiences with college organization I honed my analytical and communication skills in a organization environment. Skilled in the use of accounting software such as Microsoft Excel, SAP, and ABSS, I am able to adapt and work effectively both individually and in teams.', '3,68', '-hilalhasiandiputra@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-Perum PGRI blok G 1', '81266700625', 'leadership,teamwork,sap', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:36', '2026-07-06 20:58:36'),
