(3748, '4112201126', 'I’m currently studying Managerial Accounting at Polytechnic State of Batam and have a growing interest in management accounting, taxation, and how businesses use data to make better decisions. I enjoy learning how accounting supports business operations, especially in areas like budgeting, cost control, and performance analysis. \r\nIn 2024, I was grateful to receive the Bank Mandiri Scholarship and was selected as an Awardee of a Student Exchange Program at Universitas Negeri Yogyakarta, which gave me the opportunity to experience new cultures and learning environments. I’m also actively involved in the Polibatam English Club as part of the media and publication division, where I’ve gained valuable skills in teamwork, creativity, and content creation.\r\nI’m currently exploring SAP and interested in how ERP systems can help accounting and business processes. I’m always open to opportunities to gain new experience through internships, projects, or collaboration in the fields of accounting and finance.', '3.82', 'cintaaulia0804@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam', '8992050018', 'accounting,software accounting,microsoft excel', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:36', '2026-07-06 20:58:36'),
