(3757, '4112201135', 'A student of Managerial Accounting at Politeknik Negeri Batam with a good understanding of financial accounting, cost management, and financial report analysis. Able to work carefully, in an organized way, and finish tasks on time. Has experience in preparing basic financial reports and can use accounting software such as Microsoft Excel, ABSS, and SAP. Ready to learn and contribute in a professional work environment through an internship program.', '3.76', 'horitaacityy323@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling Kamboja Blok X/05', '89673662529', 'Microsoft Excel ,Microsoft Word,SAP', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:36', '2026-07-06 20:58:36'),
