(4388, '4122201004', 'Mahasiswa Politeknik Negeri Batam semester 6 jurusan Manajemen Bisnis, memiliki antusiasme tinggi untuk mengaplikasikan pengetahuan teoritis dan keterampilan praktis melalui program magang. Dengan rata-rata IPK yang solid sebesar 3.89 hingga semester 6, memiliki pemahaman yang kuat dalam prinsip-prinsip manajemen bisnis dan didukung oleh menyusun presentasi yang efektif dan persuasif, serta mengembangkan ide-ide inovatif untuk berbagai keperluan. Saya memiliki antusiasme untuk mengaplikasikan kemampuan ini dalam lingkungan kerja yang dinamis.', '3,89', 'jscamnda22@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum Citra Permata Resident Blok L no 1, Kecamatan Sungai Harapan Kelurahan Sekupang, Kota Batam', '85837987631', 'Microsoft Office,Canva &amp; Adobe Illustrator ,SAP dan ABSS Akuntansi', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4389, '4122201005', 'Student of Business Management, Applied Business Administration Study Program, 6th semester \r\nat Batam State Polytechnic. Proficient in Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) and skilled \r\nin administrative tasks, business correspondence, data processing, and document management. \r\nHighly motivated to learn, able to work independently or in a team, and eager to develop skills and \r\nknowledge through internship experience in a professional environment.', '3.90', 'aryanirachma1402@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Batu Aji Indah AU/14', '89623641036', 'Microsoft Word,Microsoft Excel,Microsoft Power Point', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4390, '4122201006', 'I am Imelda Fitri Yanti, an active student of the D4 Applied Business Administration program at Batam State Polytechnic. I have a high interest in developing professional skills and work experience through internship programs. With a background in business administration, I have a strong understanding of management concepts, organizational strategies, and data input that supports efficiency in the work environment. During my studies, I was actively involved in projects that trained leadership skills, teamwork, and problem solving. I am also familiar with the use of various administration and digital marketing software that can support effectiveness in the business world.', '3.90', 'amelksj412@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Indah 1 Blok C No25', '85715260422', 'Microsoft Excel,Microsoft Word,Administrative', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4391, '4122201007', 'As a Business Management student at Politeknik Negeri Batam, I am committed to building a professional career in Human Resources. My academic background, combined with hands-on experience in product management and organizational projects, has equipped me with strong capabilities in talent acquisition, employee engagement, organizational development, and learning &amp; development. I am passionate about fostering inclusive and high-performing workplace cultures. With a solid understanding of agile methodologies and a continuous improvement mindset, I am eager to contribute strategically to HR initiatives that align with business goals and drive organizational success.', '3.92', 'nannytambunan12@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sagulung Sumber Jaya Blok A10 no 22', '82283063530', 'Ms office ,English', 0, '-', 'https://www.instagram.com/xnyy.id/', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/17nannytambunan/', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
