(4394, '4122201010', 'Active 6th Semester Student of Applied Business Administration (D4) at Batam State Polytechnic with a strong passion for continuous learning and professional growth. Skilled in time management and effective communication, with a keen interest in Administration, Secretariat, Events, HR Generalist roles, Office Applications, and Sports. Actively involved in organizations, gaining valuable experience that enhances communication, leadership, teamwork, and time management skills. Eager to leverage these skills to deliver exceptional performance in any professional environment and pursue career opportunities that foster both personal and professional development.', '3.80', 'julianleonardo292@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum Arse Indah, Kav.Lama, Batu Aji', '87779708232', 'Microsoft Office - Team Work,Videography - Time Management,Communication-Problem Solving', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4395, '4122201011', 'Mahasiswa Manajemen Bisnis, Program Studi Administrasi Bisnis Terapan semester 6 di \r\nPoliteknik Negeri Batam. Memiliki keterampilan yang baik dalam mengoperasikan Microsoft \r\nOffice (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), serta berpengalaman dalam menangani pekerjaan \r\nadministrasi, pengolahan data dan penyusunan dokumen. Memiliki pemahaman dasar dalam \r\nmanajemen operasional, dan pemasaran. Mampu berkomunikasi dengan baik, bekerja secara \r\ntim maupun individu. Memiliki ketertarikan tinggi untuk memperluas wawasan dan mengasah \r\nkemampuan melalui pengalaman magang di lingkungan kerja profesional.', '3.91', 'wulanregia033@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sawang Permai Blk F No. 12B', '895614831236', 'Hard Skill  Soft Skill  jawab', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
