(4397, '4122201013', 'I am an active student of D4 Applied Business Administration at Batam State Polytechnic. I am experienced in the field of Administration. I am also studying Digital Marketing and Human Resource Development in college. In addition to technical expertise, I also have quite prominent organizational experience. This combination of technical and creative skills strengthens my ability to work effectively in various projects, both in data management and in the field of communication and media, relevant to the business world.', '3.83', 'ferdiansyahdwiprasetyo14@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Mantang Blok R/11A', '6282268479878', 'MS Office,Managing Correspondence,Editing : Canva &amp; Capcut', 0, 'https://polibatam.id/Twitter_Ferdiansyah', 'https://polibatam.id/Instagram_Ferdiansyah', 'https://polibatam.id/Linkedin_Ferdiansyah', 'https://polibatam.id/Facebook_Ferdiansyah', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
