(4404, '4122201020', '-Mahasiswa Politeknik Negeri Batam program studi Administrasi Bisnis Terapan semester 6. Dengan\r\nminat besar dalam bidang administrasi perkantoran, manajemen dokumen, serta layanan\r\npelanggan. Teliti, komunikatif, dan memiliki kemampuan organisasi yang baik. Siap untuk belajar\r\ndan berkontribusi dalam lingkungan kerja profesional melalui program magang', '3.8', '-rezandinc0857@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-Pancur Biru Lestari 2 blok G no 13, Kec Sei Beduk, Kel Duriangkang, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau.', '85363828411', 'Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) Canva &amp; Capcut Fluent Indonesian', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4405, '4122201021', 'Mahasiswa Jurusan Manajemen Bisnis, Program Studi Administrasi Bisnis Terapan Semester 7 di\r\nPoliteknik Negeri Batam dengan minat pada bisnis, marketing, dan keuangan. Berpengalaman memimpin\r\nkomunitas serta berbagai proyek kampus, seperti Program Wirausaha Merdeka, Pengembangan Bisnis\r\nProduk Polibatam, dan Event Manajemen &amp;amp;amp; Bisnis. Berpengalaman dalam public speaking, penyusunan\r\nstrategi bisnis, serta memiliki dasar akuntansi, pengelolaan keuangan sederhana, dan pemahaman\r\nsoftware bisnis (Microsoft Office, MYOB/ABSS, SAP Fundamental). Adaptif, komunikatif, dan terbiasa\r\nbekerja langsung di lapangan.', '3,91', 'viona.adiningtyass@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum Cipta Asri Tahap II Blok Inai no 30, Tembesi, Batam – Kepulauan Riau', '81275622704', 'Microsoft Office (Word &amp;amp;amp; Excel,Software MYOB/ABSS/SAP Funda,accounting &amp; Report', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4406, '4122201022', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4407, '4122201023', 'My name is Dhea Ardin Virginayu, an active student in the Applied Business Administration program at Politeknik Negeri Batam with a current GPA of 3.80. Skilled in using Microsoft Office, especially Word, Excel, and PowerPoint. Able to work accurately and in an organized manner, highly motivated to learn, and ready to contribute in a professional work environment.', '3.80', 'ardinedhea@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Oma Batam Center Blok B1 No 29', '89623545370', 'Microsoft Office,Letter &amp; Report Writing    ,Document Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4408, '4122201024', 'Mahasiswa Politeknik Negeri Batam, jurusan Manajemen Bisnis, Semester 6, dengan minat dibidang bisnis, marketing dan Human Resource Development. Aktif dalam kegiatan kampus, seperti relawan, kepanitiaan, pengembangan bisnis produk polibatam dan program wirausaha merdeka. Saya terlatih untuk bekerja langsung dilapangan, mampu bekerja secara tim maupun individu serta memiliki kemauan untuk belajar. Saya juga mudah beradaptasi dengan lingkungan baru.', '3,87', 'nayanovika62@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Kolam Blok 9b no 06, Bengkong, Batam-Kepulauan Riau', '89623366691', '#CustomerSatisfaction #SalesMarketing #VisualDesigner #MicrosoftOffice', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4409, '4122201025', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4410, '4122201026', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4411, '4122201027', 'In my 6th semester of Applied Business Administration, I began to explore various important aspects in the business world that are more specific and applicable. I studied operational management, which involves managing and optimizing production and service processes. Apart from that, I was also introduced to human resource management concepts, which include recruitment, employee development, and performance evaluation. This course not only teaches theory, but also invites students to apply their knowledge through case studies and group projects.\r\n\r\nIn this semester, I also learned about financial management, which provides an in-depth understanding of how to manage company finances, create budgets, and conduct financial analysis, learn how to read financial reports, understand cash flow, and assess the financial health of a business. It also emphasizes the importance of long-term financial planning and investment, which is very important for business sustainability and growth.', '4.00', 'retnisriningsih3@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sagulung Sumber Sari Blok C8 No 34', '85767288592', 'Microsof Office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4412, '4122201028', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
