(4414, '4122201030', 'I am Rima Tenia, a student at Batam State Polytechnic in the Applied Business Administration program. I am currently 22 years old and have internship experience as an HR staff member, where I gained experience in handling administrative tasks and document management. I am a disciplined, honest individual who is capable of working in a team and has a high enthusiasm for learning new things. With this background, I am ready to make a positive contribution in a professional work environment.', '3,84', 'rimatenia13@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Seraya Atas RT.001 RW.005', '87897916362', 'Office,Fast Typing, Teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4415, '4122201031', 'Applied Business Administration student with a strong interest in management, marketing, entrepreneurship, and human resources. Accustomed to working in teams and individually, with skills in document management and office administration using Microsoft Office. Highly motivated, detail-oriented, and adaptable, with a strong willingness to learn and grow professionally.', '3.93', 'nurullatifa236@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida Ayu Blok S No.16, Mangsang, Sungai Beduk, Batam', '89684297652', 'Microsoft Office,Teamworks,Adaptable', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
