(4417, '4122201033', 'Business Administration student with experience in secretarial work, entrepreneurship, and business\r\n management. Skilled in handling administrative tasks, document management, and communication.\r\n Familiar with SCM, ERP, and marketing. Actively involved in organizational and entrepreneurial projects,\r\n with strong teamwork and time management skills', '3.8', 'fazilamahari03@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Kolam blok H1 No.43, Sadai, Bengkong, Batam', '87812599707', 'Accustomed to preparing activity proposals, sponsorship  proposals, making correspondence', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
