(4429, '4122201045', 'An active student in the Applied Business Administration Program at Batam State Polytechnic with a strong interest in the field of business administration. Possesses a solid foundation in document archiving, data processing, and note-taking. Known for being detail-oriented, responsible, and adaptable in a dynamic work environment. Enthusiastic about learning new things and capable of working both independently and collaboratively.', '3.97', 'shellamaya1903@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-', '62895603660729', 'Microsoft Office,Google Workspace,Adaptable', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4430, '4122201046', 'Student of Applied Business Administration D4 study program of Batam State Polytechnic who always wants to continue learning new things, get career opportunities, can manage time and communicate well. . Has a great interest in Administration, Secretariat, Event, HR Generalist and Public Relations. Active in organizations and has experiences that help me develop communication, leadership, teamwork, and time management skills.', '3,7', 'lovelonebp@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '85268068397', 'Aplikasi Office, Personal Ability, Team Work', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
