(4476, '4122201094', 'A sixth-semester student in the DIV Applied Business Administration Program at Politeknik Negeri Batam with strong understanding of  business management and administration. Possesses analytical capabilities, effective communication skills, and problem-solving aptitude developed through project-based learning experiences. Has practical experience in retail and entrepreneurship gained through active participation in bazaar events, developing valuable skills in customer service and sales management. Committed to continuously developing professional competencies and making positive contributions within business environments.', '3.76', 'rahmadanirestu1111@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Air Mas Plaza Blok D No. O7', '82286970998', 'Microsoft Office,Google Workspace,canva', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
