(4480, '4122201099', 'I am a Business Management student with applied business administration study program at Batam State\r\nPolytechnic, who has great interest in business management, information technology, digital marketing.\r\nI do active in campus activities and have good communication and teamwork skills. I am currently seeking\r\nan internship opportunity to develop practical skills and contribute positively in a professional environment.', '3,78', 'steven.yobel123@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Mangsang Permai Blok A Nomor 80', '89518797508', 'Public Speaking,Microsoft Office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4481, '4122201100', 'A highly motivated Business Management student with a strong curiosity in Human Resources,\r\nBusiness Processes, Supplychain Management and Public Relations. Experienced in HR\r\nadministration, recruitment, and human resource management through campus organizations and\r\nprojects. Skilled in employee data management, candidate selection, and has a fundamental\r\nunderstanding of labor law. Proficient in Microsoft Office, Google Workspace, and possesses\r\nexcellent English communication skills (both written and verbal). Eager to contribute to an HR team\r\nin a multinational company.', '3,81', 'ismedmanurung26@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Jalan Ahmad Yani, Tlk.Tering Kec.Batam Kota, Kota Batam Kepulauan Riau 29461', '81276380783', 'Hard Skills Proficient in Microsoft Office Suite (Excel, Word, PowerPoint)', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4482, '4122201101', 'A sixth-semester Applied Business Administration student with experience in digital branding, publication design, copywriting, and SME mentoring. Has mentored 4 SMEs, including the Jasa Raharja program. One promotional TikTok post garnered over 77,000 views and doubled sales. Alumni of Entrepreneur Generation in Digital Marketing.', '3.83', 'rahmaliaa052@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Buana Regency Blok B No 63', '85838113696', 'Communication | Teamwork | Time Management | Creativity | Problem Solving | Adaptability | Initiative Responsibility | Accuracy  Administrative | Adaptabili', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4483, '4122201102', '-A final-year Applied Business Administration student with strong teamwork, communication, and time management skills. Experienced in campus projects related to business strategy, social media marketing, and SOP audit. Eager to apply administrative and analytical abilities in a professional internship setting', '3,91', '-silvinavila767@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-Perumahan Taman Sari, Blok C No. 54', '857612131036', 'Microsoft Office,Time Management ,Team Collaboration', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4484, '4122201103', 'I am a 6th semester student of the Applied Business Administration Study Program who has an\r\nunderstanding of management, administration, and communication. I am able in the use of Microsoft Office\r\n(Word, Excel, and PowerPoint) to support administrative tasks, as well as data management and\r\norganization. With the ability to work collaboratively in a team, I am ready to make an active contribution to\r\nthe implementation of company tasks and activities through the internship program.', '3.93', 'nindawahyuni019@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Kepuluan Riau', '85658411580', 'Microsoft Word ,Microsoft Excel ,Google Workshop', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4485, '4122201104', 'My name is Anggun Dwi Lestari, an active student of the Applied Business Administration Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic with a GPA of 3.91. I have extensive experience in event management, digital marketing, and public relations. I am currently active as a Wedding Organizer at Essy Wedding Batam, and have interned as a Project Manager at Infinite Learning through the Batch 7 Certified Independent Study Internship program.\r\n\r\nDuring my studies, I was also active in various organizations and social activities, such as Generasi Baru Indonesia (GenBI) as secretary of the health division, as well as the Women&amp;amp;#039;s Initiative Network at Caterpillar and the Youth Mentoring Program. I have skills in project management, digital marketing, content creation, and public communication. Some of my achievements include becoming a Bank Indonesia Scholarship Recipient 2024, Best Project Intern Infinite Track 2024, and Champion of Putri Hijabfluencer Kepulauan Riau 2022.\r\n\r\nWith a combination of work experience, communication skills, and dedication to self-development, I am ready to contribute optimally in a professional team and continue to grow in the world of work.', '3.91', 'anggundwilestari42@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Villa Muka Kuning, Kelurahan Tembesi, Kecamatan Sagulung, Kota Batam', '8984050937', 'Project Management, Public Relations,Problem Solving', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4486, '4122201105', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
