(4488, '4122201107', 'Administration student of Batam State Polytechnic. Experienced in administrative data \r\nmanagement, project management, and digital marketing. Able to manage information in a \r\nstructured manner, coordinate tasks between sections, and develop result oriented marketing \r\nstrategies. Interested in human resources, especially in human resource development. \r\nAccustomed to a collaborative environment, adaptive to change, and committed to \r\ncontinuously developing self competence through continuous learning and innovation.', '3.94', 'sriwahyuni05316@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Raya THP III Blok HC NO. 26', '82284876949', 'Microsoft Office, Leadership,Teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
