(4499, '4122201118', 'Experienced in data management, administrative documentation, and structured program coordination. Skilled in working with precision and accuracy within a team environment, with a strong interest in administration, operational management, and process efficiency. Actively involved in collaborative projects and committed to achieving accurate and well-organized results.', '3.93', 'kabhitaa@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Botania Garden Residential Complex, Block C2 No.22A, Batam, Riau Islands, Indonesia', '82268153677', 'Administrative Documentation,Project Management,Communication Skills', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
