(4513, '4122201138', 'Applied Business Administration student with demonstrated leadership experience as President of the Entrepreneur Generation student organization. Possesses strong interest and foundational knowledge in internal control systems, human resource management, and supply chain management. Highly adaptive and capable of contributing effectively within internal organizational environments, with a solid understanding of organizational behavior and culture.', '3.82', 'adityasiagian2003@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tg Riau, Marina, Perumahan Taman Laguna Indah, Blok C1 No 7', '895323537333', 'Internal Control Systems,Human Resource Management, Supply Chain Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4514, '4122201139', 'A 7th semester Applied Business Administration student at Politeknik Negeri Batam with leadership and organizational experience. Skilled in event management, communication, and teamwork. Proficient in Microsoft Office, basic design editing, and English communication. Ready to contribute professionally in the field of business administration.', '3.51', 'quilankirana11962@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling Bukit Pelita Indah, Blok D4, Kelurahan Kabil, Kecamatan Nongsa, Batam', '83190584378', 'Microsoft Office,Leadership,Teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4515, '4122201140', 'Mahasiswa Administrasi Bisnis Terapan yang memiliki fondasi akademis dalam bidang manajemen, keuangan, pemasaran, dan sumber daya manusia. Pengalaman organisasi yang berfokus pada pengelolaan program kerja dibidang kewirausahaan dan administrasi. Memiliki kemampuan dalam pengelolaan data dan penyusunan dokumen administrasi.  Memiliki ketertarikan dan motivasi tinggi untuk mengembangkan kemampuan di bidang administrasi, pemasaran, serta pengolahan data secara sistematis dan efektif. Terbiasa bekerja secara kolaboratif dan berorientasi pada hasil dengan memperhatikan ketepatan waktu dan ketelitian dalam setiap tugas yang dijalankan.', '3.84', 'dianaterbitiapane23@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam', '82361367094', 'Teamwork, communication, microsoft office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4516, '4122201141', 'An Applied Business Administration student with a strong interest in management and office administration. Skilled in data management, document archiving, and preparing organized and structured administrative reports. Able to perform data entry using Microsoft Office. Experienced in working both independently and in a team, with the ability to adapt quickly to new environments. Also highly motivated to learn and eager to develop professional skills.', '3.85', 'florensnight17@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Indah 2', '82392722812', 'Microsoft Office,Problem Solving,Time Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
