(4521, '4122201146', 'I am a Business Administration student with a strong academic background in management, marketing, finance, and human resources. My academic and organizational experiences have shaped my abilities in planning and executing programs in administration and entrepreneurship.\r\nI have practical skills in data management, financial reporting, administrative documentation, and am proficient in using Microsoft Office tools such as Word, Excel, and PowerPoint to support day-to-day business tasks. I am also passionate about marketing and effective communication strategies to support business development and operational efficiency.\r\nI am motivated to continue learning and developing my skills. I enjoy working collaboratively and am committed to contributing to organizational goals through structured and efficient work processes.', '3.79', 'Canuraisyah423@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Buana Garden Tanjung Piayu Sei Beduk', '87899613037', 'Administrative &amp; Document Man,Data Processing &amp; Microsoft Of,Organizational Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4522, '4122201147', 'Mahasiswa Administrasi Bisnis dengan pengalaman organisasi yang berfokus\r\npada pengelolaan program kerja di bidang kewirusahaan dan Administrasi.\r\nMemiliki kemampuan dalam pengelolaan data, penyusunan dokumen\r\nadministrasi, serta pelaporan kegiatan secara sistematis dan tepat waktu. Selain itu,\r\nterbiasa bekerja secara kolaboratif dengan kemampuan interpersonal yang baik\r\ndalam komunikasi dan kerja tim. Memiliki minat besar untuk berkontribusi di\r\nbidang Human Resource dan administrasi perusahaan.', '3,88', 'septirahayu2693@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tiban Lama Rt/Rw: 003/001', '81390266166', 'Teamwork,Communication,Microsoft Excel', 0, 'https://polibatam.id/twitter', 'https://polibatam.id/instagram', 'https://polibatam.id/Linkedinn', 'https://polibatam.id/instagram', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4523, '4122201148', 'I am a student of Applied Business Administration with a strong interest in administrative work, human resources, and event coordination particularly in accommodation and logistics where collaboration and communication are key.\r\nI have experience serving as an event coordinator and secretary in various campus activities, including supporting administrative and logistical needs for my university’s robotics team. Additionally, I have worked in human resources-related tasks, managing communication and coordination within teams.\r\nI also manage a small creative business called Cron by Winiiy, which specializes in custom acrylic flower boards. I occasionally serve as a master of ceremony for both formal and informal events.\r\nI am a responsible, communicative, and highly motivated individual who enjoys working with others and continuously seeks opportunities for professional growth.', '3.77', 'windijayaarista03@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida Ayu, D3, Kec. Sungai Beduk, Kel. Mangsang, Batam', '89623385193', 'emotional intelligence,confidence,team work', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
