(4613, '4122211063', 'I’m an enthusiastic individual who is experienced as an assistant. have good computer and basic English\r\n communication skills. I enjoy challenging positions as administrative staff, data entry, or office assistant. For\r\n providing support with administrative tasks and ensuring accuracy in data entry. I am eager to work in a\r\n dynamic and collaborative environment where I can contribute to the success of the company while\r\n continuously learning and enhancing my skills.', '3.89', 'hestiaprilia.m@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Sari Blok B No. 32', '82384264225', 'Administrative Assistance,Microsoft Excel,Customer Service', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
