(4617, '4122211067', 'A motivated professional with experience in accounting, quality assurance, and customer service. Skilled in Microsoft Office, cashflow management, document handling, and problem-solving. Proven ability to work in dynamic environments, deliver accurate results, and provide excellent service. Eager to contribute to company growth through dedication and efficiency.', '3.73', 'elizartwn@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Air Mas Plaza blok E no 18', '895370110885', 'Microsoft Office,Cashflow &amp;amp; financial reporting,Time management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
