(4621, '4122211072', 'Applied Business Administration student (Batam State Polytechnic) who is organized and has experience as an Administrator. Mastering various modern administrative support software with time management, detailoriented, effective communication, and teamwork skills. Ready to contribute as Office Administrative Staff to support company operations.', '3.87 / 4.00', 'juwitamagdalena2604@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Kolam Blok I1 No.18', '6282342053077', 'Microsoft Office Suite,Google Workspace ,Document Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
