(4623, '4122211074', 'I am a cheerful, adaptable individual with a strong work ethic and a friendly attitude. From 2021 to 2024, I gained valuable experience in administrative and operational support within a company. My responsibilities included managing work schedules, recording employee leave, coordinating internal transportation and business travel arrangements, organizing meeting rooms, and supporting both HR and production departments. \r\nCurrently, I am pursuing a degree in Applied Business Administration at Politeknik Negeri Batam, where I continue to strengthen my knowledge and skills in business operations and management. \r\nOutside of work and study, I have been a volunteer with YOVOLUN since 2021, contributing to various humanitarian initiatives including visits to orphanages and food distribution efforts.\r\nI continually strive to improve my skills in management, creativity, and leadership.', '3.78', 'mayaselviana72@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav. Sei Lekop Blok C4', '81261589812', 'Microsoft Office,SAP,Data Entry', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
