(4632, '4122211084', 'I am a seventh-semester student majoring in Applied Business Administration at Politeknik Negeri Batam, with a strong interest in administrative and office management. Currently, I am working as an Administrative Staff at SMAN 20 Batam, where I am responsible for managing documents, organizing records, and supporting daily administrative operations.\r\n\r\nI am proficient in Microsoft Office and have a fundamental understanding of SAP. I am also highly adaptable, capable of working effectively in a team environment, and committed to delivering quality work. With my practical experience and eagerness to learn, I am ready to contribute positively to an internship program and further develop my professional skills', '3.79', 'faradillameilani382@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Nusantara 1', '82163246619', 'Microsoft Office,SAP Fundamental ,Basic Data Entry &amp; Reporting', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
