(4644, '4122211097', 'Mahasiswa aktif Program Studi Administrasi Bisnis dengan latar belakang pendidikan SMK\r\n Akuntansi. Memiliki pemahaman dasar yang kuat dalam pencatatan keuangan, administrasi\r\n perkantoran, dan proses bisnis. Terbiasa menggunakan Microsoft Office, serta memiliki\r\n kemampuan komunikasi yang baik dan mampu bekerja secara tim maupun mandiri.', '0', 'natasyaavrilia040403@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida KSB Tiban Mentarau Blok G No 23-24', '87798173200', 'Sofware perkantoran ,pengelolaan arsip ,pengelolaan dokumen', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
(4645, '4122211098', 'I am an active student at Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Applied Business Administration with a concentration in Business Management. Accustomed to working in a team, analytical thinking, and good communication skills. Experienced in managing small projects and developing simple marketing strategies.', '3,70', 'putridarmataa@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav. Bengkong Kodim Blok E No 27B', '6281371690979', 'I have a strong interest in entrepreneurship, digital marketing, and operational management. I am accustomed to working in teams', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
