(4651, '4122211104', 'I am an active sixth-semester student at Politeknik Negeri Batam, majoring in Business Administration. I have a strong interest in administration and documentation, and I am experienced in using Microsoft Excel, Word, and PowerPoint to complete various academic projects. I am highly motivated to learn, creative, detail-oriented, and capable of working in a team. I also have experience working as a kitchen crew member, which trained me to work quickly, neatly, and in an organized manner.', '0', 'yuliarahmaw0704@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum Taman Marchelia Block B no 25', '85173398683', '•   Ms. Word, Ms. Excel, Ms. PowerPoint', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
