(4669, '4122301004', 'An Applied Business Administration student (6th semester) at Politeknik Negeri Batam with hands-on experience in operations, digital branding, and business development. Proven track record in supporting projects such as warehouse operations analysis, tourism branding initiatives, and MSME development.\r\n\r\nExperienced in developing SOPs, executing content strategies, and assisting with business legalization processes (NIB), with a strong focus on improving operational efficiency and brand visibility. Recognized as a highly organized, adaptable, and proactive individual who thrives in dynamic environments.\r\n\r\nSeeking internship opportunities in Human Resources and Operations Management to leverage both administrative and creative capabilities in delivering impactful business solutions.', '3.93', 'kirreyputri@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Rosinton Raya Blok F no 10', '81276179467', 'Word,Excel,PowerPoint', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:37', '2026-07-06 20:58:37'),
