(4857, '4132201010', 'I am an active student in the International Trade Logistics program at Politeknik Negeri Batam with a strong understanding of various logistics aspects, including procurement, port operations management, and warehouse and inventory management. I possess strong analytical skills in problem-solving and am capable of working collaboratively in a team to achieve common goals. Through organizational experience, I have developed effective communication and leadership abilities in various situations. I am highly motivated to continuously grow and contribute to the international trade logistics industry.', '0', 'aclarissa549@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav Bida Kabil Blok Seruni 2 No. 21', '85760996247', 'ms office  ,team work ,communication', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4858, '4132201011', 'Mahasiswa Politeknik Negeri Batam jurusan Manajemen Bisnis Internasional - Logistik Perdagangan\r\n dengan pengalaman di bidang logistik, administrasi, dan pengelolaan bisnis. Memiliki kemampuan\r\n komunikasi, kerja tim, dan analisis data, serta minat besar dalam industri retail dan jasa. Terampil\r\n menggunakan Microsoft Office, Excel, ERP, dan WMS.', '0', 'jasonafiq@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Nusa jaya blok A14 no.11 kelurahan sungai panas.', '88807269372', 'Manajemen Logistik &amp; Dokumentasi Kepabeanan, Administrasi &amp; Koordinasi,  Analisis Data &amp; Pelaporan', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4859, '4132201012', 'An active student at Politeknik Negeri Batam majoring in International Trade Logistics, with a strong interest in logistics, customs, and supply chain management. Possesses a solid foundational knowledge through coursework such as Introduction to Logistics and Supply Chain, International Trade, Freight Forwarding, and Distribution and Transportation. Demonstrates strong problem-solving and communication skills developed through organizational involvement and active participation in various committees.', '3.77', 'mechandra2003@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Hang Tuah blok A5 no 11, Baloi Permai, Batam Kota', '895603694203', 'Microsoft Office,SAP Fundamental ,SCM Globe', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4860, '4132201014', 'An active undergraduate student in the International Trade Logistics program at Politeknik\r\nNegeri Batam. Highly interested in logistics, procurement, supply chain management, port and\r\noperations management, as well as warehouse and inventory management. Certified in SAP\r\nFundamentals and Basic Customs. Proficient in Microsoft Office and experienced in teambased environments. Eager to enhance practical skills through internship opportunities.', '3.82', 'windri.an28@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Villa Sampurna 1 Blok H1 No 4, Kelurahan Tiban Indah Kecamatan Sekupang, Kota Batam', '85156327989', 'Time Management, Effective Communication, Teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4861, '4132201015', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4862, '4132201018', 'An active student of the International Trade Logistics Study Program at Politeknik Negeri Batam with a GPA of 3.77/4.00. Experienced in logistics, warehouse management, and procurement through various Project-Based Learning (PBL) initiatives. Demonstrates effective communication skills, adaptability, discipline, creativity, and enthusiasm for learning new things. Highly interested in the development of efficient and integrated logistics and warehousing systems.', '3.77', 'Rangga.4132201018@students.polibatam.ac.id', 'default.jpg', '-', '82171076041', 'Microsoft Office  ,SAP Fundamental ,SCM Globe', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
