(4865, '4132201024', '- A 6th-semester student at Batam State Polytechnic, International Trade Logistics program, with a\r\nstrong interest in logistics, international trade, supply chain management, warehousing, procurement,\r\nand administration. Experienced as a Secretary, with proven skills in document management,\r\nattention to detail, multitasking, and communication. Known for being adaptable, collaborative, and\r\ncommitted to delivering high-quality results. Eager to contribute and grow professionally in the\r\nlogistics and international trade sector.', '3,88', '-diandraalya20@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '- Perum MK Indah 1 Blok BQ no. 24', '85265276066', 'AP System Navigation for Logis,Microsoft Office,Organizational Skills', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
