(4867, '4132201026', 'Active student in the field of International Business at Politeknik Negeri Batam. Has experience in logistics and cargo management, and has achieved recognition in a university-level logistics competition. My favorite subjects include Project Management, English, Human Resources and Organizational Culture, Occupational Health and Safety and Environment, as well as Warehousing.', '3.73', 'felixrussell45@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kurnia Djaja Alam , Parkit 8 No.31, Batam', '82170015757', 'Public Relations,English proficiency,Warehouse Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
