(4884, '4132201054', 'Saya mahasiswi semester 7 Jurusan Manajemen Bisnis, Program Studi Logistik Perdagangan Internasional di Politeknik Negeri Batam. Memiliki kemampuan dalam penggunaan aplikasi administrasi seperti Microsoft Word, Microsoft Excel, Power Point, dan Google Docs. Disiplin dan mampu bekerja dengan baik dalam tim.  Aktif dalam kegiatan organisasi dan memiliki pengalaman PBL (Project Based Learning).', '3,62', 'aprilianatasya137@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batu Merah, RT. 23 / RW.07 No.68A', '85232503161', 'Canva,Word ,Excel', 0, 'https://polibatam.id/apriliantsya_', 'https://polibatam.id/apriliantsya', 'https://polibatam.id/LinkedlnApriliaNatasya', 'https://polibatam.id/aprilianatasya', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4885, '4132201055', 'I am a student of D4 - International Trade Logistics Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic who has a strong interest in the world of logistics and business. During my education, I have been actively studying various aspects of international trade and logistics management, from distribution process to supply chain management and warehousing. In addition, I have also had professional experience as a receptionist in the hospitality industry, which gave me a real understanding of the importance of service, accuracy, and communication in the world of work.\r\nI am known as a responsible person, able to adjust to various situations, and have a high spirit in completing tasks to the fullest. Working in a team or individually is not an obstacle for me, because I believe that cooperation and independence are two important things in building a solid career. I am committed to continuous learning and development, and ready to face new challenges to support my long-term goal of contributing to the field of logistics and distribution management.', '3.70', 'aniliasepti01@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Komp. Bunga Setangkai RT 003 RW 008, Batam Center', '81534974091', 'Word, Excel,SAP Fundamentals', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
