(4912, '4132201111', 'Undergraduate Student in International Trade Logistics at Politeknik Negeri Batam, passionate about freight forwarding, customs, and supply chain management. I have recently completed the Independent Student Exchange Program (PMM) Batch 4 at Universitas Padjadjaran (2024), where I expanded my expertise in Business Logistics while keeping it aligned with my major. Through this program, I also participated in Modul Nusantara, gaining deeper insights into Indonesia’s cultural heritage.\r\n\r\nI am a Bank Indonesia Scholarship Awardee and an active member of Generasi Baru Indonesia (GenBI) Batch 5, where I engage in leadership development and social initiatives.\r\nCo-Author of &amp;amp;quot;Buku Pendampingan Penggunaan Aplikasi CEISA&amp;amp;quot;, an E-ISBN-indexed guidebook for CEISA users, developed as part of a professional training program.\r\nI hold BNSP Public Speaking Certification (2024) and SAP Fundamental Certification (2024), enhancing my skills in professional communication and ERP systems for supply chain management.\r\n\r\nOpen to internship opportunities in freight forwarding, customs, and supply chain management to further develop my skills and contribute to the logistics industry.\r\nFeel free to connect with me!', '-', 'rinaromasta0110@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'MANGSANG PERMAI BLOK E NO 135 KECAMATAN SUNGAI BEDUK KELURAHAN MANGSANG KOTA BATAM', '82164107951', 'Microsoft Excel,Microsoft Word,Microsoft Powerpoint', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
