(4916, '4132201115', 'As a 6th semester student of Business Management majoring in International Trade Logistics at Batam State Polytechnic, I have a strong interest in procurement, customs, and shipping. During my studies, I have developed skills and abilities in leadership, communication, teamwork, and public speaking. I am also skilled in using administrative applications such as Microsoft Office, SAP, and Minitab. I am also always involved in every Project Based Learning related to logistics management and its application in the world of work. I believe that my discipline, ability and skills will be an added value for the company. I am ready to face new challenges and contribute significantly in a dynamic work environment.', '3.90/4.00', 'syahlini0805@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Taman BatuAji Indah II Blok Q/08', '85805355244', '#Team Work, #logistic,#supply chain', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
