(4927, '4132201131', 'I am a final year student of the International Trade Logistics Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic with astrong interest in logistics management and global trade. Experienced as a surveyor in a collaborative projectwith Bank Indonesia, and recognized as an Outstanding Student with achievements in logistics. Goodanalytical, communication, and field coordination skills. Ready to contribute to the professional world with ahigh spirit of learning and teamwork.', '3.87', 'febriantidesti3@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahana Ricci Kec. Sekupang, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '85765130412', 'Skill Microsoft, Data Processing ,SAP', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4928, '4132201132', 'I am a student of International Trade Logistics at Politeknik Negeri Batam, passionate about procurement, purchasing, and inventory optimization. In academic projects, I executed end-to-end procurement simulations, tracking 50+ items and managing data from 10+ suppliers using SAP MM &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; SD and advanced Excel. I redesigned the warehouse layout to increase storage capacity by 25% and conducted delivery route analysis to reduce inefficiencies by 15%. Additionally, I prepared and delivered data-driven logistics presentations using Canva. I am proficient in Excel (PivotTables, IF, SUMIF), SAP MM and SD, and Canva. Detail-oriented and quick to adapt, I am ready to apply my skills through a procurement or inventory internship.', '3.56', 'hafizhmaulana168@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Modena Residence Blok D No. 1', '6285891373713', 'Advanced Excel (PivotTables) ,Procurement Process,SAP Material Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
