(4949, '4132211062', 'I Rahmadhani Annisa Fitri, am an active Business Management student concentrating in International Trade Logistics at Batam State Polytechnic. Experienced as an admin in a building store, I am accustomed to managing bookkeeping, administration, and improving communication and customer service. During my studies. I studied SAP, Minitab, project management, marketing, and public speaking, and was active in organizations. I have mastered administrative, management, and customer service skills, and am ready to contribute professionally in the fields of business and logistics.', '0', 'annisaanis628@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bengkong Sadai Blok M1 No: 26, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau , Indonesia', '82268572397', 'Minitab ,SAP ERP,Microsoft office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
