(4955, '4132211077', '6th semester student of Business Management Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic with concentration in International Trade Logistics. Have a basic understanding in supply chain management and export-import activities. Skilled in the use of various administrative and data analysis applications, including Microsoft Office, SAP, and Minitab. Ready to contribute in a professional work environment with high learning spirit.', '3,63', 'muhammadrasyidalghifari@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Buana Regency,Belian,Batam kota', '85374285737', 'Microsoft office,SAP,Mini Tab', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
(4956, '4132211078', 'D4 student from Batam State Polytechnic, Department of Business Management, International Trade Logistics Study Program. I have Curiousty learning new things, detail oriented and has aspirations to work in the logistics industry, Retail, import-export, purchasing, shipping, inventory and Human resources. Mastering knowledge regarding warehouse management, export-import administration and warehousing', '3.91', 'nataliangln15@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bukit indah batu aji tahap 2 blok D1 no 17', '82133760535', 'Continious Learning, Initiative, Leadership', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
