(4963, '4132211096', 'I am a D4 student from Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Business Management, International Trade Logistics Study Program. I have a strong curiosity to learn new things, am meticulous in detail, work hard, have high enthusiasm, and enjoy work that focuses on shipping and logistics. I am also skilled in using MS Office, document management, and systems used in related companies.', '3.2', 'jesicamput@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman raya 3 blok GF 9 Batam Centre', '6285238103260', 'MS WORD, ENGLISH,INDO', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
