(4970, '4132311063', 'Sixth-semester International Trade Logistics student with hands-on experience in operational administration, inventory control, logistics documentation, and operational coordination gained through academic projects and administrative work experience. Knowledgeable in export-import documentation, freight forwarding procedures, warehouse operations, and stock monitoring. Proficient in Microsoft Excel, data management, and logistics administration, with strong attention to detail, analytical thinking, adaptability, and the ability to work collaboratively in fast-paced operational environments.', '3.75', 'mashaauliaputry@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Pasar Rakyat Tembesi Blok AA No. 08', '82289063214', 'Logistics Administration,Inventory Control ,Data Reporting', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38');
