(5256, '4212201022', 'A Mechatronics Engineering student with practical experience in electrical engineering, electronics, and manufacturing systems. Proficient in 3D mechanical design and capable of interpreting technical drawings and technical modeling. Responsible, disciplined, adaptable, and proactive\r\nin personal development and practical problem-solving.', '3.69', 'bgsyogi77@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav. Bukit Layang Blok C No. 59, Sei Beduk, Batam', '8984064112', 'Mechanical,Electrical,Graphic Design', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
