(5263, '4212201029', 'Majoring in Electrical Engineering with a concentration in Mechatronics Engineering at Batam State Polytechnic,\r\nI am a student. Skilled in engineering drawing, 3D design, and electrical systems. Seeking a qualified position to\r\napply expertise in designing and implementing innovative solutions to complex engineering challenges. Have a\r\nproven track record of success in project management, problem solving, and cross-functional collaboration.\r\nProficient in utilizing cutting-edge technologies to optimize processes and improve overall efficiency.', '3.88', 'ansjasitepu@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling lama batu aji blok D 13', '81534005747', 'electrical engineering,mechanical enginering,ms office', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
