(5285, '4212201051', '6th semester Mechatronics Engineering student with hands-on experience in PLC programming, UI design, wiring, and technical documentation. Involved in projects that combine virtual assets with physical hardware in realtime, simulating industrial systems for educational use. Experienced in designing virtual environments and user interfaces, especially for VR and Android platforms. Has working knowledge of PLC programming, circuit design, and electrical wiring, supported by involvement in various VR and Android-based development projects. Fast learner, adaptable, and eager to deepen technical skills through hands-on engineering experience.', '3.86', 'yuliarahmah1412@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Batu Besar, Block J2 No. 6, Sambau Subdistrict, Nongsa District, Batam City', '895613567407', 'VR Asset Design,Android App Development,PLC Programming and Wiring', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
