(5290, '4212201056', 'I am an active student in my 7th semester majoring in Electrical Engineering, Mechatronics Engineering Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic. I have expertise in the mechanical field through 3D design and modeling using SolidWorks, as well as in the electrical field covering installation, wiring, and automation systems. I am an enthusiastic, adaptable individual with a strong motivation to learn directly in the field. Through internship opportunities, I am committed to honing my skills, expanding my practical experience.', '3.42', 'kreshnakreshna123@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Jl. Taman Marchelia Blok A no 214,  Batam, Kepulauan Riau, 29413', '82287438957', 'Mechanical design,Data Analysis,Technical Documentation', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:38', '2026-07-06 20:58:38'),
