(5294, '4212201060', 'I am a final-year student of the D4 Mechatronics Engineering Program at Batam State Polytechnic with a strong interest and skill focus in the electrical and automation fields. I have a basic understanding of control systems, electrical systems, and industrial automation. I am oriented toward continuous learning, able to adapt quickly, and possess good communication and teamwork skills.', '3.70', 'Zainalabidin.m03@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan PGRI Blok L. No 12, Kelurahan Sei. Binti, Kecamatan Sagulung, Kota Batam', '6285767820788', 'Electrical Wiring,Mechanical &amp; Electrical Design,PLC Programming', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
