(5296, '4212201062', 'Active 7th-semester undergraduate student in Mechatronics Engineering (Electrical Engineering\r\nDepartment) at State Polytechnic of Batam. Experienced in mechanical design, electrical installation,\r\nautomation systems, and robotics projects, with hands-on roles as PIC in multiple multidisciplinary\r\nprojects. Developed a YOLOv11- based deep learning system for defect detection as a final project,\r\nincluding dataset preparation, model training, evaluation, and real-time implementation. Strong in\r\nteamwork, technical documentation, and problem-solving.', '3,74', 'syahardi132@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tanjung Teritip RT. 04 RW. 10 Blok A No. 16', '87818738984', 'PLC programming using Ladder Diagram,Object detection using YOLO ,Dataset collection', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
