(5308, '4212201075', 'I am a current 8th-semester student in the Mechatronics Engineering program at Batam State Polytechnic. I have experience in designing electrical systems and integrating sensors into automation systems. I am capable of performing basic PLC programming. I am proficient in using SolidWorks for mechanical design and modeling, and I have basic AutoCAD skills for simple engineering design needs. Additionally, I possess basic proficiency in using GX Works3 and utilizing Factory I/O for automation system simulation. I have foundational experience in project management, including task planning, time management, and coordination within a team. I am eager to gain hands-on experience in the industrial sector to develop my technical skills and understand real-world work processes in the field.', '3.64', 'hafizmoh0210@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'RULI EDEN PARK NO.A86 TAMAN BALOI, BATAM KOTA KOTA BATAM', '89531773177', 'Electrical Wiring,Drafting : Solidworks,Electrikal Design : Proteus', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
(5309, '4212201076', 'An experienced mechatronics engineer with GPA: 3.88, expertise in Mechanical, Electrical, and \r\nProgramming, specializing in 3D Design and Animating 3D designs using Solidworks. Skilled in PLC \r\nwiring, reading electrical diagrams, and PLC programming. Has experience working on projects within a \r\nteam.', '3.88', 'ahmadsaidwijaya@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'PERUMAHAN CITRAMAS INDAH BLOK L NO. 31', '89509675862', '3D Mechanical Design and 3D Mechanical Animation using SolidWorks,Electrical design PLC wiring PLC programming,basic programming C# Python', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
