(5312, '4212201079', 'Seventh-semester student of the Mechatronics Engineering Program at Polytechnic State of Batam, skilled in mechanical design, electrical systems, and basic programming for microcontroller-based automation systems. Experienced in creating technical designs using SolidWorks, as well as understanding electrical wiring based on circuit diagrams. Currently active as a member of the electrical division in the development of humanoid robots and autonomous robots.', '3,88/4,00', 'spuanshazinta@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Komplek Orchid Park Block D No.51', '82280476214', 'Mechanical Design: SolidWorks ,PCB Design: Kicad &amp;amp; Eagle,Electrical &amp;amp; Wiring', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
