(5315, '4212201082', 'I am an active student in my 8th semester of the Applied Diploma (D4) in Mechatronics Engineering at the Batam State Polytechnic with experience in automation projects, control systems, and microcontroller programming. I have participated in Project-Based Learning, which includes system design, hardware–software integration, as well as project documentation and reporting. I am accustomed to working in teams, understand project workflows, and am committed to developing technical competencies in an industrial setting.', '3.58', 'elvanjodri6@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida Asri 1 Housing, Batam Centre, Riau Islands, Indonesia', '8136757080', 'Electrical Assembly and Wiring,PLC Programming: Ladder Logic ,Problem Solving', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
