(5318, '4212201085', 'I am an hard and smart work student at State Polytechnic of Batam with study program Mechatronics\r\nEngineering. During college i studied on the integration of mechanical systems, electronics, control, and\r\ncomputing to design and develop modern automation systems. I have a strong interest in technology\r\ndevelopment, particularly in the fields of automation and robotics. I am a highly competent and\r\nconscientious worker. I will prove this when given the chance. I am also very driven and dependable.', '3.56', 'fadlisandi3@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'TIBAN LAMA RT 02 RW 04 NO 16', '81949405705', 'PLC Programming,HMI/SCADA,DESIGN 3D', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
