(5324, '4212201091', 'I am a Mechatronics Engineering student currently entering my 7th semester at Batam State Polytechnic. I have strong interests and hands-on experience in Electrical &amp; Instrumentation Systems and Industrial Automation. I previously joined the BRAIL humanoid robot team as a mechanical designer, contributing to the development of a soccer-playing humanoid robot. I am skilled in using CAD and CAE tools for designing and simulating technical solutions. Additionally, I have a solid foundation in machine learning and deep learning, which I applied in my final project to detect and classify malaria based on cell types. I am eager to contribute to innovative engineering projects and continually enhance my expertise in industrial technologies.', '3.64', 'fikrialbadawi@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kota Batam, Provinsi Kepulauan Riau, Indonesia', '89516392981', 'Mechanical,Electrical, Automation and Instrument Con', 0, '-', '-', 'www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-fikri-stkanno1903', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
