(5329, '4212201096', '-I am an active student in Mechatronics Engineering with a strong academic record. I have a strong\r\ninterest in the fields of automation, PLC, Internet of Things, and Machine Learning, with a focus on tool\r\ndesign, communication between devices, and extracting valuable insights from complex raw data to\r\nsupport decision-making. I have practical experience using Mitsubishi PLCs, Omron PLCs, Arduino,\r\nESP32, Python and C++, SQL, and data analysis libraries such as Pandas, NumPy, and Matplotlib. I\r\nam proficient in using GXWorks3, Arduino IDE, Jupyter Notebook, and Visual Studio Code for PLC\r\nprogramming, microcontroller programming, data processing, and model development. During my\r\nstudies, I completed certified training programs in PLC, introduction of Software Engineering, and Data\r\nAnalytics guided by RevoU, and actively applied my skills in academic and real-world projects, such as\r\nIoT system integration, classification modeling, and data visualization. I am a dedicated and\r\nhardworking individual with a strong commitment to continuous learning and professional growth. I am\r\nable to work well both independent and in a collaborative team.', '3.75', '-pratamalisme@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-JL. KUTILANG I NO 4 KDA', '81361512359', 'PLC,EMBEDDED PROGRAM,IOT', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
