(5347, '4212211013', 'Vocational School graduates majoring in Mechatronics Engineering who have work experience as Quality Analysis for more than 1 year. From this experience, I have an understanding of quality inspection, defect identification, analysis defect of reject material from process external or internal, understanding of the production process and know of work safety procedures. And also have the ability to work with engineers to collect data and analyze a material. Have career interests in the field of management and document handling and other related fields', '0', 'putriamandasilaen123@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-', '89620201246', 'PLC,LABVIEW, PNEUMATIK', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
