(5360, '4212211026', 'Hi everyone, my name is Abdul, I am a seventh-semester Mechatronics Engineering student with hands-on experience in automation systems, robotic maintenance, and production process improvement. Currently, I serve as an Assistant Process Engineer, where I contribute to optimizing manufacturing workflows, improving machine reliability, and helping in new product development. My background as an Automation Technician has equipped me with strong technical skills in troubleshooting, equipment repair, and preventive maintenance. I am proficient in identifying root causes, implementing solutions, and ensuring equipment runs at peak efficiency. I thrive in dynamic environments that require critical thinking, adaptability, and precision. My ability to work both independently and collaboratively with cross-functional teams has supported successful outcomes in production and automation projects.', '3.61', 'abdulrahmanalifputra@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Masyeba Kirana Blok D No.12', '8217001480', 'Maintenance and Repair,Process Engineering', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
