(5362, '4212211028', 'Electrical designer and programmer at VMES 4.0 (PT MES Teknologi Indonesia) and a fresh graduate mechatronics engineering student from Politeknik Negeri Batam. Keen desire for further develop programming and electrical skills with expertises in electrical wiring, microcontrollers, robotics, web and database development, Internet of Things (IoT) systems, and various engineering software. Contributed to organizations for years by hosting community services and events. Ready to bring knowledge and commitment to a fast-paced work environment.', '3,47', 'trikurniawanego@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'PERUMAHAN PUTRI 7 BLOK F NO 4', '85271437549', 'PLC,HMI,ELECTRICAL', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
