(5368, '4212211034', 'An HVAC engineering professional with a proven track record, who currently balances extensive field experience with formal education of Bachelor of Applied (D4) Mechatronics Engineering (GPA 3.61). Experienced in leading projects from start to finish, ranging from the installation of 8 chiller units at PT Sumitomo to the execution of a multi-stage Daikin VRV system at PT PCI. Skilled in managing large-scale cooling system operations (York YK 1000 TR) and troubleshooting in challenging environments such as marine (PAX OCEAN) and 24/7 manufacturing (INFINEON, TDK). Ready to take on new challenges as a Project Engineer or Site Engineer, where I can combine deep practical expertise with modern engineering principles.', '3.6', 'abdulrasid1232@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batu aji', '81363819349', 'HVAC System Design &amp; Installation (Chiller, VRV/VRF, Split', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
