(5568, '4222201008', 'I am currently a student at Batam Polytechnic, majoring in Electrical Engineering with a focus on Robotics Engineering. I have skills in wiring, design, and programming using Visual Studio Code, along with internship experience and active involvement in campus extracurricular activities.\r\nI am a reliable team player, adaptable, and able to work under pressure. I am honest and responsible in completing tasks.', '0', 'salsabila.mecha@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Villa Muka kuning A3/26, Tembesi, Kec. Sagulung, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau 29439', '81364867683', 'Soft Skill :  Good Teamwork,Hard Skill :  Pemograman : Pyt,Software Skill : Visual Studio', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
(5569, '4222201009', 'I am a Robotics Engineering Technology student at Batam State Polytechnic with professional experience as a Machine Operator. I possess strong practical skills in troubleshooting and maintaining production machinery, further strengthened through in-depth study in robotics. I am currently actively contributing to the Barelang Robotics &amp;amp; Artificial Intelligence Lab (BRAIL), where I am involved in the development of innovative robotics projects. I am an adaptable individual with proven problem-solving skills in both industrial and laboratory environments, and I am able to work effectively both independently and as part of a team.', '3.73', 'arya45927@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Komp.Bidadari Block B no.176', '6289623368991', 'ROS2,C++,Python', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
