(5593, '4222201034', 'My name is Fitria Salsabillah, and I am a seventh-semester student in Robotics Engineering with a primary focus on software development for robotics, including motion control, embedded systems, and robot communication. I specialize in programming using Python, Lua, and C++, with a focus on developing motion recording and control systems for humanoid dance robots. Supported by additional skills in CAD modeling with SolidWorks and basic electrical engineering (wiring and reading schematic designs), I can contribute effectively to the mechanical–electrical–software integration workflow. With strong adaptability, teamwork skills, and a willingness to learn, I am committed to contributing to research-driven and technology-focused industries.', '3.83', 'ftryasalsa0502@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tembesi Bengkel, Gang Mesjid No 05, RT 04, RW 01, Kibing, Batu Aji, Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '82170216223', 'Programming Languages: Python,CAD Design: Basic SolidWorks  ,Electrical: Wiring and Reading', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:39', '2026-07-06 20:58:39'),
