(5913, '4232201048', 'I am an active student at State Polytechnic of Batam, majoring in Electrical Engineering with a focus on Power Plant Engineering Technology. I have a strong interest in the development and efficiency of power generation systems, both conventional and renewable.\r\n\r\nThroughout my studies, I have gained a solid foundation in electrical principles, control systems, power plant maintenance, and the utilization of new and renewable energy. I am passionate about creating sustainable and efficient energy solutions, and I constantly seek to stay updated with the latest technological advancements in the energy and electrical sectors.\r\n\r\nI am known for being detail-oriented, collaborative, and highly motivated to learn. I am open to internship opportunities, research projects, or collaborative work in the energy sector—especially those focused on innovation and efficiency in power generation systems.\r\n\r\nMy goal is to contribute to the advancement of sustainable energy by becoming part of a technical or engineering team in the energy sector, with a particular interest in environmentally friendly power generation systems.', '3,81', 'hernicutrizatampubolon@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sekupang', '85260653697', 'Communication,Teamwork,Time Management', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
