(5926, '4232211001', 'Active students from the Energy Generation Engineering Study Program who have a great interest in electricity systems, energy efficiency, and modern generation technology. Accustomed to working with discipline, has basic electrical technical skills, and is ready to learn directly in a professional environment.', '3,42', 'ramadhanikhsan316@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling Sagulung Baru Blok N no 118', '81995364501', 'Basic Electric Instalation,PVSyst(analysys eficiency PV),Protection System', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
