(5928, '4232211003', 'I am Budiman Ramadhan, an active undergraduate student in the Energy Power Plant Engineering program at Politeknik Negeri Batam. I have a strong interest in renewable energy, power generation systems, and energy efficiency. Throughout my studies, I have been exposed to technical subjects such as thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, steam and gas power plant systems, as well as basic electrical and control systems.\r\n\r\nI am actively involved in campus organizations and technical projects related to energy and technology. Additionally, I have participated in various seminars and training sessions focusing on energy transition, modern power generation technologies, and environmental sustainability. I am a highly motivated learner, a good team player, and I possess strong analytical and problem-solving skills.\r\n\r\nI am eager to continue developing my knowledge and skills through industrial internships or research projects, with the goal of contributing to the advancement of sustainable energy in Indonesia.\r\n\r\nIn addition, I also attended several seminars, webinars, and training sessions, such as:\r\n1. Gas Turbine Instrumentation - Batam Commissioning Hub (2025)\r\n2. BE PART OF OIL AND GAS - BCH GOES TO CAMPUS - UNRIKA (2025)\r\n3. BUILDING A CAREER IN OIL &amp;amp; GAS - BCH TO CAMPUS - POLIBATAM (2025)', '3.2', 'budiman3484@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida ayu blok v no 14', '895639139163', 'microsoft office,AutoCAD,Etap', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
