(6002, '4242201032', 'I am a 7th-semester student in the Electronic Engineering Technology program with a strong understanding of the design, analysis, and implementation of electronic systems. I am experienced in working with analog and digital circuits, microcontrollers, and embedded systems. I have been involved in various electronics-based projects, including PCB design, hardware programming, and system integration.\r\n\r\nI am capable of working both independently and in a team, with strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail in testing and troubleshooting. I actively keep up with the latest developments in electronics and automation technology. I am eager to contribute to an internship program to further develop my technical and professional skills in an industrial environment.', '3.34', 'tasyaatriaprilia@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Griya Pratama Blok CC No 11, Batu Aji, Bata,', '81575674656', 'microcontrollers, PCB design,AutoCAD', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6003, '4242201035', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
