(6008, '4242201047', 'Currently enrolled in the sixth semester of the Electronics Engineering Technology Program, Department of Electrical Engineering, Batam State Polytechnic. During my studies, I have developed expertise in the following areas: Robot Line Follower, Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs), Object Detection, Embedded Systems, Microcontrollers, and Internet of Things (IoT) Technology.', '3.64', 'maxsavenlbs@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Housing Prima Garden Block O number 18, Batam, Indonesia.', '89623016120', 'Good Communication,Teamwork,Electrical System', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6009, '4242201052', '-An active final-year student of Batam State Polytechnic with a strong passion for learning and \r\nexploring new technologies. Experienced in assembling and testing electronic devices, with hands- \r\non involvement in projects. Proficient in technical skills such as soldering, design, and utilizing \r\nMicrosoft Office tools. A team-oriented individual with excellent communication, leadership, and \r\nproblem-solving abilities, honed through organizational roles experience. Currently seeking an \r\ninternship opportunity to apply and further develop my knowledge and skills in a dynamic industrial \r\nenvironment', '3.51', '-kelv71955@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-KAV BARU BLOK B7 NO 71', '895609606884', 'Microsoft Office   Soldering', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6010, '4242201055', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
