(6012, '4242201058', 'A D4 student in Electronic Engineering Technology at Politeknik Negeri Batam, with expertise in \r\nelectronics engineering including the design, development, and maintenance of microcontroller\r\nbased systems. Highly curious, disciplined, and able to work in a team. Experienced in various \r\nmicrocontroller projects.', '3.80/4.00', 'anandaaidil26@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Indonesia', '8994857423', 'Auto CAD,Arduino IDE,Ultimaker Cura', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6013, '4242201061', 'Hello everyone! 😊\r\nMy name is Shalhan 🙎‍♂️, and I am a 7th-semester student in the Electronics Engineering Technology program at Batam State Polytechnic.\r\n\r\nI actively enhance my skills by working on projects using software such as:\r\n👉Circuit Simulation: LTSpice, Livewire, SIMetrix, and Matlab: Simulink🔌\r\n👉PCB Design: Proteus and Kicad 🦺\r\n\r\nI am very interested and open to collaborating in the field of electronic engineering, with the hope of sharing knowledge and experience while creating innovative solutions together. 🤝💡', '3.73', 'shalhan.4242201061@students.polibatam.ac.id', 'default.jpg', 'Jalan Bengkong Harapn 1 Blok C no. 57', '82283892216', '#electrical', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6014, '4242201063', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6015, '4242201066', 'I am a student at Politeknik Negeri Batam majoring in Electronics Engineering Technology, with hands-on experience in electronics manufacturing, industrial automation, and 3D design using SolidWorks. I have a strong foundation in electrical systems, technical documentation, and embedded programming using ESP32 and Arduino. Currently, I am developing a deep learning-based inspection system to detect soldering defects on through-hole PCBs using YOLOv11x, integrated with a custom GUI. I am open to learning and collaborating in the fields of automation, electrical instrumentation, and intelligent systems.', '3.54', 'windaadilla252@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'PERUM MKGR BLOK BINA UMMAH 4 NO 3', '81930208509', ': Leadership, Good Time Management, Responsible at work', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
(6016, '4242201071', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
