(6019, '4242201081', 'I am an Electrical Engineering student at Batam State Polytechnic with an interest in industrial electronics, control systems, and automation. I have a basic understanding of electrical systems, sensors and actuators, PLCs, and electronic measurement. I am accustomed to working on engineering-based projects such as control system design, programming, and system analysis.', '3.56', 'pdezalna@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'TAMAN RAYA 3 BLOK HS NO. 24', '81266022574', 'Electrical,SolidWork,AutoCAD', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
