(6029, '4242211022', 'A graduate of SMK Negeri 1 Batam majoring in Industrial Automation Engineering, currently pursuing a degree in \r\nElectronic Engineering Technology at Politeknik Negeri Batam. Highly passionate about the manufacturing and \r\nindustrial automation field, with strong technical skills in reading engineering drawings, assembling and \r\nunderstanding electrical circuits, and operating PLC and Pneumatic systems.\r\nProficient in Microsoft Office to support both administrative and technical tasks. Recognized as a dedicated, \r\nhardworking, and results-oriented individual with a strong commitment to continuous learning and professional \r\ngrowth in the field of industrial automation and electronics.', '0', 'ramadhanmuha99@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Nusa Jaya Blok A5 no. 3, Sungai Panas, Batam', '81275730580', 'Basic PLC (Programmable Logic Controller) Programming Reading and Interpreting Engineering Drawings Operating Pneumatic Systems Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) Proficiency Strong Teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
