(6032, '4242211037', 'Final-year Electronic Engineering Technology student with hands-on experience as a\r\nQuality Inspector in the manufacturing industry. Skilled in quality inspection, measurement\r\ninstrument calibration, and product testing based on industrial standards and SOPs.\r\nPossesses knowledge in electronics, PCB systems, and IoT development, supported by\r\nstrong analytical thinking and problem-solving abilities. Highly motivated to gain practical\r\nengineering experience through internship programs and contribute effectively to\r\nengineering and operational activities within the company.', '3.18', 'hagastarigan@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bida Ayu Blok O No 03', '82268348773', 'Quality Inspection and Product,Measuring Instrument Calibrati,Microsoft Office (Word', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
