(6035, '4242211046', 'I am currently pursuing a Diploma 4 (D4) in Electronic Engineering Technology at Batam State Polytechnic. I have two years of experience in the electronics industry and three years in social insurance. I possess a basic understanding of electrical systems, electrical parameter measurements, technical diagram reading, implementation of work and safety procedures, and am proficient in administrative processes. I can work effectively in both teams and individually, as well as build collaborations with external stakeholders.', '3.45', 'miftahul.jhd07@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kav. Flamboyan Blok G No 74', '85766126771', 'PLC,Microcontroller,AutoCAD', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:40', '2026-07-06 20:58:40'),
