(6538, '4312201066', 'I am Ilham Syarif, a Multimedia Engineering Technology student at Batam State Polytechnic with hands-on experience in graphic design, front-end development, IoT integration, and hardware prototyping. I have taken roles as a scriptwriter, website and mobile app developer, and hardware engineer in various project-based learning (PBL) initiatives. I have also applied my design skills in organizational activities such as social media content, event branding, and publications. Additionally, I possess strong communication, teamwork, problem-solving, and leadership skills, demonstrated through my role as the leader of a Student Creativity Program (PKM) team.', '3.75', 'ilhamsyarif1810@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sagulung sumber seraya Blok B14 No.78', '6281992673452', 'Graphic Design,Front-End Development,Visual Design', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:41', '2026-07-06 20:58:41'),
