(6540, '4312201068', 'I am a 6th semester student of Multimedia Engineering Technology study program at Batam State Polytechnic, focusing on digital marketing and content creation. I have good interpersonal skills and am able to manage various projects efficiently. I am organized and reliable, successfully managing multiple priorities with a positive attitude to achieve team goals. This is evident from my ability to complete each task well. During my college years, I have worked on several projects especially in writing video scripts, umkm video promotion, creating newsletter articles, and creating UI/UX designs for web applications. I am ready to give my best contribution to the company.', '3.83', 'muthiadianty75@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kepulauan Riau, Batam, Indonesia', '895605182956', 'Document Management Skills, Effective Communication Skills, Adaptability and teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:41', '2026-07-06 20:58:41'),
