(6704, '4312211079', 'I am a dedicated and flexible IT Support and Web Developer with hands-on experience in managing networks, security systems, and troubleshooting hardware/software issues. I have contributed to projects involving cashier systems, CCTV, access control, and attendance systems, applying practical problem-solving skills.\r\n\r\nThrough internships and volunteering, I also explored UI/UX design and responsive web development, working in both professional and community-based teams. I regularly use tools like Python, Laravel, Flutter, MySQL, AutoCAD, Figma, and Adobe Creative Suite.\r\n\r\nI enjoy learning new technologies and am passionate about delivering reliable support and user-focused digital solutions. I’m open to roles in IT, development, or multimedia where I can grow and make a positive impact.', '3.94', 'lianaaputri18@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Cipta Permata Blok C No 07', '8984053486', 'Python Programming,Laravel Framework,Flutter Development', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:41', '2026-07-06 20:58:41'),
