(6967, '4322201052', 'Hi, i am a student at Politeknik Negeri Batam majoring in Animation, with a specialization in 3D Modeling. With over three years of hands-on experience in the animation industry, I’ve been involved in a variety of creative projects including internships at multinational companies, freelance work, national-level competitions, and project-based learning from campus. Throughout my journey, I’ve had the opportunity to collaborate with diverse teams, adapt to various pipelines, and explore different styles and software.', '3.79', 'pangestugilang40@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sagulung Berseri Blok A No.27', '895609904520', '3D Modelling,3D Animation', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
