(6974, '4322201059', 'Hi there! Welcome to my profile.\r\nMy name is M. Maulana Asshiidiq, but you can call me Maulana. I am a Creative Generalist with extensive experience across various creative fields, and currently a student in the Animation Study Program at Politeknik Negeri Batam.\r\n\r\nI have led both personal and collaborative projects as a project leader for over three years. My experience in game design and development, 2D and 3D animation production, comic creation, and graphic design has strengthened my adaptability in tackling a wide range of multimedia visual challenges.\r\n\r\nWith this internship opportunity, I’m highly motivated to collaborate with the team in a fun and productive environment to successfully bring great ideas to life!.\r\n\r\nThank you for visiting! Email me for collaboration: maulana.animations@gmail.com\r\nSee you soon!', '3.96/4.00', 'maulana.animations@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Riau Islands, Indonesia', '6282279156635', 'Blender,Adobe Illustrator,Davinci Resolve', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
