(6977, '4322201062', 'I am a passionate illustrator and aspiring animator with experience in freelance projects ranging from personal commissions to business illustrations. I have worked as a line artist for a Webtoon Canvas project and contributed as a clean-up and shading animator in the short 2D animation “The Fox.” In 2025, I was honored to win 2nd place in the Animation &amp;amp;amp;amp; Videography category at the International PBL Expo. With strong skills in digital illustration, storytelling, and visual design, I enjoy bringing creative ideas to life and am eager to grow further in the creative industry.', '3.7', 'bentosmiley@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kepulauan Riau, Kota Batam', '6282386393644', 'Digital Illustration,Clip Studio Paint', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
