(6980, '4322201065', 'A 6th semester student from Batam State Polytechnic who is an expert in 3D Animation, especially modeling. Has an understanding of the Animation pipeline (pre-production, production, post-production). Experienced in Game Development as a Game Artist. Have been part of an entrepreneurial animation product. Able to work well with PBL team. Able to work under pressure.', '3.95', 'aidilpart100@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling Tunas Regency BLOK KD NO. 10', '82268909197', '3D Modeler,Effect &amp; Simulation,LRC', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
