(6987, '4322201072', 'Saya adalah Mahasiswa Politeknik Negeri Batam dari Prodi Animasi, yang berfokus modeling 3D dengan style Low Poly. Bukan itu saja saya suka dalam pembuatan aset creation game dan pembuatan enviroment design. Saya terus mengembangkan keterampilan saya dalam animasi 3D, pemodelan, tekstur material, dan meconba mempelajari dasar-dasar Unity untuk kebutuhan game.', '3.73', 'ilhamdiisrij768@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Bumi Agung Permai, Blok F No 7, Batu Aji', '895627177700', '3D Modeller', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
(6988, '4322201073', 'Animation student at Batam State Polytechnic (GPA 3.80) with over 2 years of experience in animation and game development projects, focusing as a 3D Artist Generalist. Proficient in the complete 3D production pipeline including modeling, texturing, rigging, animation, lighting, rendering, and compositing. Experienced in leading teams and communicating project visions effectively with clients. Currently seeking opportunities to grow both technically and artistically through impactful and challenging creative projects.', '3.80', 'candrajeky04@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'perum merapi subur blok D no12a', '6282283296087', '3D artist generalist,modeller 3D,storyboard artist', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
(6989, '4322201074', '-3D Environment Artist and Animator based in Batam, Indonesia. I am passionate about world-building and bringing environments to life. My journey into 3D art started with a fascination for lowpoly and realistic visuals, which led me to explore various techniques in modeling, lighting, and texturing. Using Blender as my primary tool and sometimes Substance Painter for achieving realism, I enjoy crafting immersive scenes that tell a story. Whether it&#039;s a realism Props and object or a lowpoly environment setting, I aim to create worlds that feel alive.', '3.77', '-jeremypardede5@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '- JALAN KARTINI 3 NO 58 A, Sungai Harapan, Kecamatan Sekupang, Kota Batam, Provinsi Kepulauan Riau', '81351791118', '3D MODELING,3D ENVIRONMENT,3D ANIMATION', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
