(7003, '4322211010', 'Hi! Im David Natanael Saragih, a multidisciplinary 3D Artist based in Batam, Indonesia. I specialize in 3D animation, modeling, and visual effects, combining artistic vision with technical skill to craft compelling visuals across various mediums. From product animations to creative cinematic sequences, I bring ideas to life with precision and personality.\r\n\r\nWith strong experience in Blender, Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator), and CorelDRAW, I’m able to build everything from stylized characters to polished commercial renders. I also integrate video editing, lighting design, and 2D elements like sketching and vector illustration to enrich every frame I produce.\r\n\r\nWhether you&amp;#039;re looking for a full-time collaborator, contract-based artist, or a freelance partner, I’m here to deliver creative results that speak volumes—visually and emotionally.', '3.72', 'natanaelsaragih32@gmail.com', 'ybMicmpJ9NnbRen.jpg', 'Genta 2 Blok T No.1', '8986211951', 'Drawing,Design,3D Artist', 0, 'https://twitter.com/DavidNatanaelS5', 'https://www.instagram.com/davidsrgh32_/', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/david-natanael-saragih-438abb24a?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_flagship3_profile_view_base_contact_details%3BHVaaKogtRCmvc29ahlv8JA%3D%3D', 'https://www.facebook.com/david.saragih.1426', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
