(7023, '4322301038', 'A 3D Animation student 20 years old focused on Lighting, Rendering &amp; Compositing (LRC), 3D Modeling, and Visual Effects  using Blender. Interested in realistic visuals and the 3D production process from modeling to final rendering. Accustomed to self-learning and exploring various techniques to create engaging and communicative visual works for different digital media needs.', '3.58', 'marsaulinarahel8@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam center, Teluk Kering, Perumahan Citra Batam, Blok D 94', '83183609796', '3D Skills 3D Modeling Texturin,Software Skills Blender Natron', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
