(7025, '4322301045', 'I am a sixth-semester student in the Animation Department at Batam State Polytechnic, with interests and expertise in 3D modeling, lighting, video editing, and visual content development. I have experience working on various PBL projects on campus, ranging from creating 3D character assets, environments, and props to creating textures, lighting, and editing teasers and animated videos. I also have experience creating game assets and opening cutscenes.', '3.56', 'annisafakhirah01@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Sari Padjajaran Blok D no.23', '89643201160', '3DModelling,3DLighting,3DTexturing', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
