(7171, '4332201004', '6th-semester Cybersecurity Engineering student at Politeknik Negeri Batam. Experienced in DDoS simulations\r\n(Python/Paramiko), encryption systems (SSL/TLS/SSH), penetration testing (web/mobile/network) including gov’t app\r\nVAPT, and AI pest detection (TensorFlow/OpenCV). Proficient in ISO 27005-compliant risk analysis, cybersecurity tools\r\n(Linux/OWASP), and programming (Python/PHP/JS/TS) with Laravel/Flask &amp; MySQL/MongoDB. Combines technical\r\nskills with teamwork to solve real-world security challenges.', '3.65', 'ridhosyahputra.junaidi@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '85765605838', 'Linux,Python,VAPT', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
