(7176, '4332201009', 'I am a student in the Cybersecurity Engineering Study Program (RKS) focusing on the field of Offensive Security. With a deep interest in cybersecurity, I actively develop my skills and knowledge through various projects and research.\r\n\r\nBesides formal studies, I have a passion for writing articles to share my knowledge and experience. As I learn new things, I enjoy documenting and sharing them through writing. You can find some of my articles on my blog: https://medium.com/@AhmadSopyan \r\n\r\nWith the combination of academic study and writing experience, I strive to continue to grow and contribute to the field of cybersecurity, especially in the offensive aspect.', '0', 'ahmadsopyan1903@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Citra Batam, Blok D/241, Teluk Kering, Kota Bata, Kepulauan Riau', '85955262346', 'Penetration Testing, Red Team Analysis , Basic Scripting &amp;amp; Automation', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
