(7179, '4332201012', 'A graduate of Computer Network Engineering that currently pursuing a Diploma in Cybersecurity\r\nEngineering at Batam State Polytechnic. Passionate about technologies, particularly system administration\r\nand cyber security. Possess hands-on experience in building and securing network infrastructure, with solid\r\nskills in network installation, system administration, and cyber security, ensuring both security and reliability.', '3.88', 'yogiralif@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Taman Lestari Blok D28 No 16 Kel. Kibing, Kec. Batu Aji, Batam, Kepulauan Riau, 29422', '82169515574', 'Networking,Cyber Security,System Administration', 0, '', 'https://www.instagram.com/id.yogi2/', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/yogi-rahman-alif-a4b025219/', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
(7180, '4332201013', 'Cyber Security Engineering student 6th semester at Batam State Polytechnic specializing in Defensive Security. Experienced\r\nin identifying vulnerabilities, securing systems, and strengthening network security. Skilled in server testing methodologies\r\nand monitoring tools such as Smokeping, Uptime Kuma, LibreNMS, Zabbix, Grafana, and Observium. Currently working as\r\nNOC Monitoring at PT OMNI Cloud Indonesia, handling Dell R630 server installation, network &amp; SSH confguration, system\r\nadministration, and troubleshooting. Strong analytical skills and proven ability to work in a team to improve organizational\r\nsecurity posture', '0', 'fitrahhabibullah0@gmail.com', 'MeyTstvhJA1F7GG.jpeg', 'Batam', '6285760689015', 'public speaking,networking,teamwork', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
