(7245, '4332211013', 'I am a 6th semester Cyber Security Engineering student at Batam State Polytechnic. As a\r\ndedicated Cyber Security student, I have practical practical experience in identifying vulnerabilities\r\nand securing system and network security. With knowledge of server testing methodologies and\r\ntools, I continue to develop my skills and insights in the field of cyber security. I have good\r\nanalytical skills and am able to work with teams to evaluate and improve the security posture of an\r\norganization.', '3.46', 'miramadhan1129@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kepulauan Riau, Batam, Botania, Marbella Residence', '895359916767', 'Penetration Testing,Security Operations Center ,Network Configuration', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
