(7268, '4332211036', '-I am a D4 student of Cyber Security Engineering at Batam State Polytechnic. With a strong interest in the field\r\nof cybersecurity. I can use several tools such as Burp Suite, Owasp Zap, Wireshark, Mmap, etc. In the field of\r\nnetworking such as TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, VPN, VLAN, Routing and Switching, etc. Known for my ability to\r\nlearn new technologies quickly and adapt to challenges, I am committed to continuously improving my skills as\r\na cybersecurity. I am eager to take on new opportunities to contribute and grow in the cybersecurity field', '3.26', 'khairullahagustianwirson@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Jl.Mesjid no 225 Jorong Padang Lua 1', '6285213961479', 'Burp Suite,Owasp Zap,Wireshark', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
