(7271, '4332301002', 'A Cybersecurity Engineering student actively exploring network security and infrastructure management. Experienced as a Team Leader in academic projects and developing technical skills in Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) following OWASP guidelines. Passionate about applying cybersecurity practices to real-world environments.', '3.80', 'balqisjuwita99@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Bandar Srimas Blok P No.11', '82385177907', 'Penetration Testing,IT Operations,Security Information and Event', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
