(7273, '4332301018', 'Hello, I’m Mona Safana Lubis, a sixth-semester student at Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Computer Science with a focus on the Cybersecurity Engineering program. I’m very interested in the field of cybersecurity. I enjoy learning about penetration testing, network security, SIEM, and digital forensics. During my studies, I have worked on various projects ranging from website penetration testing and SIEM implementation to the development of network-based applications and systems. I enjoy trying new things, thrive in a team environment, and am always striving to develop both my technical skills and soft skills to be ready to face the challenges of the professional world.', '3.74', 'monasafana4@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Jln. Tiban Indah Permai Blok G1 No 16', '8997270100', 'System Information and Event M,Vulnerability Analysis Penetra,Penetration Testing', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
(7274, '4332301019', 'Cyber Security Engineering student with a strong interest in Vulnerability Assessment\r\nand Penetration Testing (VAPT). Have practical experience in executing attack\r\nsimulations and basic SIEM deployment through university projects. Eager to apply and\r\ngrow my academic knowledge in a real-world professional environment.', '3.77', 'cecilia.revimarischap@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Kavling Sambau Blok D.13 RT.006 RW.003', '6285356210752', 'Penetration Testing,Vulnerability Analysis,Security Information and Event', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:42', '2026-07-06 20:58:42'),
