(7409, '4342301001', 'A sixth-semester student in the Software Engineering Technology program with an interest in\r\nwebsite development, Frontend, UI/UX, and publication photography. Experienced in web development\r\nusing CSS, Tailwind, Bootstrap, Laravel, Next.js, PHP. Active in organizations, quick to\r\nadapt, and committed to giving my best contribution in a professional work environment.', '3,91', 'aahelsimanjuntak@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Mantang Blok K no 23 Sagulung', '81270193219', 'Front end,Manage team,UI/UX', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
