(7411, '4342301004', 'I’m Tyas, a highly motivated Full-Stack Developer with a solid foundation in web, mobile, and IoT-based applications. I have completed various hands-on projects using modern tech stacks such as Typescript, Next.js, React.js, Laravel, Node.js, and more.\r\n\r\nWhat I bring to the table:\r\n\r\n- Front-end skills (Typescript, Next.js, React.js, Vue.js)\r\n- Back-end proficiency (Laravel, Node.js, Express.js)\r\n- Experience with relational &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; NoSQL databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, SQLite)\r\n- Building IoT systems with MQTT and integrating microcontrollers\r\n- Collaborative with Agile team experience\r\n\r\nMy passion lies in creating scalable, responsive, and user friendly digital products that solve real problems.\r\n\r\nI’m actively seeking internship or junior developer roles where I can grow, contribute, and build impactful solutions.\r\n\r\nFeel free to reach me at tyasweningas@gmail.com or connect with me on LinkedIn', '0', 'tyasweningas@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Indonesia, Kota Batam, 29432, Indonesia', '82389496939', 'javascript,react js,typescript', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
