(7416, '4342301037', 'I am a Software Engineering Technology student at Batam State Polytechnic with experience in developing web, mobile, and IoT-based systems.\r\n\r\nI focus on building structured and scalable applications, covering the full development lifecycle from requirement analysis, system design, implementation, to testing. I have worked on various projects including a digital office and team collaboration platform, an IoT-based color detection system, a second-hand goods marketplace platform, and a clinic management system.\r\n\r\nIn mobile development, I use Kotlin and Jetpack Compose to build responsive and modern applications. In web development, I develop systems using PHP, JavaScript, Laravel, and Express.js to create stable and well-integrated solutions. For IoT, I have experience working with ESP8266, MQTT Protocol, and TCS3200 to build connected device systems. I also manage data using MySQL and PostgreSQL, and use tools such as Git, GitHub, Postman, and Figma to support efficient and collaborative development workflows.\r\n\r\nI continuously improve my technical and problem-solving skills and am open to collaboration in building efficient and impactful digital solutions.', '3.86', 'mdzakwan315@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Renggali Nongsa Blok E No. 02', '89678976698', 'Web Development,Android Development,IOT Development', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
