(7467, '4412201022', 'Nadhira is a third year in Mechanical Engineering with a keen interest in Ship Construction and Industrial Manufacturing. She has experience in project management, design manufacture, ship design, life saving plan in ship and count cost estimate ship.\r\n\r\nNadhira has skills in engineering drawing and design using applications such as SolidWorks, AutoCAD, Autodesk Inventor and Maxsurf for industrial manufacturing design and ship construction. In addition, she has skills in the production of goods using conventional milling and lathe machines, and can operate automatic machines such as CNC Milling and Turning.', '3.65', 'nadhiraawn@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Tanjung Piayu', '8117756904', '#Fabrication,#Design,#ProjectManagement', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
