(7474, '4412201067', 'I am a student in the 7th semester of the D4 Marine Construction Engineering Technology Study Program at Batam State Polytechnic class of 2022. I am also actively involved in organizations on campus. This experience helped me develop leadership skills, teamwork, communication and good time management. With the experience I gained on campus, I am ambitious to develop and ready to contribute in the industrial world.', '3.10', 'abdulmalikruhullah@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perum. Bukit Palem Permai Blok O2 No. 07', '85837339483', 'Leadership ,Teamwork,AutoCAD', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
