(7499, '4422301005', 'I am an active student who is currently studying at the Batam State Polytechnic, Department of Mechanical Engineering, \r\nWelding Engineering Study Program with a strong foundation in mechanical engineering principles and hands-on \r\nexposure to industrial fabrication practices. Possessing a keen interest in advanced welding processes, material behavior, \r\nand structural integrity, I am committed to applying analytical thinking and technical precision to real-world engineering \r\nenvironments.Throughout my academic journey, I have developed competencies in interpreting engineering drawings, \r\nunderstanding welding standards, operating fabrication tools, and performing quality-oriented tasks aligned with \r\nindustrial requirements. I bring a proactive mindset, strong problem-solving skills, and the ability to work collaboratively \r\nwithin multidisciplinary teams. \r\nEager to pursue an internship opportunity where I can strengthen my professional capabilities, contribute meaningfully \r\nto engineering projects, and gain practical experience that supports my development into a competent and responsible \r\nwelding and fabrication engineer.', '3,49', '-fadilahmadghani2@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-perum pesona mantang kec bengkong kel tanjung buntung', '82268363496', 'design engineering ,welding inspector,ndt', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(7500, '4422301014', 'I graduated with a Mechanical Engineering diploma in 2023 and am currently in my fifth semester at Politeknik Negeri Batam, majoring in Welding and Fabrication Engineering Technology. My background includes hands-on experience operating CNC milling and turning machines during high school through real fabrication projects for industry clients.\r\nIn college, I strengthened my competencies in welding and fabrication, NDT practice through test coupon preparation, project management, technical drawing interpretation, and engineering drawing creation. I also actively improved my English skills by joining an English community and participating in competitions.', '3.6', 'najibalwanzaky@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam, Kepulauan Riau, Muka Kuning Indah 1', '895622895798', 'Technical &amp;amp; Engineering Skills •	CNC Machine Operation (Milling &amp;amp; Turning) — Experienced in operating CNC equipment for fabricating components used in pressure vessels, skids, modules', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
