(7510, '4422311005', '- Saya seorang profesional yang berdedikasi dan berorientasi pada hasil, dengan keterampilan yang kuat dalam \r\nanalisis, pemecahan masalah, dan kepemimpinan tim. Dengan latar belakang pendidikan dan pengalaman kerja \r\nsaya, saya dapat memberikan kontribusi yang berharga untuk setiap proyek yang saya ikuti. Saya memiliki \r\nkemampuan yang baik keterampilan komunikasi, kemampuan beradaptasi yang tinggi, dan kemampuan bekerja \r\nsecara efektif dalam lingkungan yang dinamis. Dengan semangat untuk terus belajar dan berkembang, saya siap \r\nmenghadapi tantangan baru dan memberikan dampak positif dalam setiap tugas yang saya jalani.”', '3.29', 'dutadirgantara1@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Perumahan Wisma Buana Indah II Blok J2 No 22, Sagulung, Kota Sagulung, Kota Batam, Kepulauan Riau', '628576195543', 'Microsoft Word', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(7511, '4422311014', 'I am a sixth-semester student at Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Mechanical Engineering with a specialization in Welding Engineering and Fabrication. Alongside my academic studies, I work as a maintenance technician, where I am responsible for preventive maintenance, troubleshooting, and equipment reliability. This combination of academic training and practical experience has strengthened my technical skills, work discipline, and understanding of industrial systems.', '3.75', 'cikalhara92@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'JL. Parkit 5 No. 2, KDA, Batam Centre', '81374541811', 'Preventive and corrective main,Welding inspection and fabrica,Reading and interpreting techn', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(7512, '4422311017', '-', '0', '-', 'default.jpg', '-', '-', '-', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(7513, '4422311023', 'I am an active student who is currently studying at the Batam State Polytechnic, Department of Mechanical \r\nEngineering, Welding Engineering Study Program, I have experience in the industrial field as a Coal Boiler \r\nMaintenance in a company. I am currently studying in the field of Welding Industry, I have a SMAW 6G \r\nWelder certificate that has been verified by the National Professional Certification Agency (BNSP), and \r\ncurrently have a CSWIP Visual Welding Inspector 3.0 certification', '3,68', 'saifulramadhan535@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'kampung utama 1 nomor 38', '89604433997', 'WELDER ,QC  INPECTION,SOLIDWORK', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
(7514, '4422311025', 'I am a fifth-semester student at Batam State Polytechnic, majoring in Mechanical Engineering with a specialization in Welding and Fabrication Engineering. I have work experience in four companies, with my most recent position as a Senior Pipe Welder at PT McDermott Indonesia, specializing in the GTAW welding process.', '2.95', 'rakaginan19@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', '-perum taman pesona indah blok i 3 no 20 kec tanjung uncang kel batu aji batam', '895603636329', 'aim WELDER GTAW AND SMAW', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
