(7517, '4422311047', 'A dedicated NDT technician with hands-on experience in performing non-destructive testing and analysis,\r\nincluding safety evaluations. Proficient in various inspection techniques such as liquid penetrant, magnetic particle, and ultrasonic testing, including advanced methods like PAUT and ToFD. Committed to continuous improvement and professional development to consistently meet high-quality standards.', '3.40', 'ariq.fm@gmail.com', 'default.jpg', 'Batam - Indonesia', '6282172223949', 'PAUT,UT,MT', 0, '-', '-', '-', '-', '2026-07-06 20:58:43', '2026-07-06 20:58:43'),
